<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">TIC</book>
  <para style="h">TIC PA LUKWENA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tic Pa Lukwena</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tic Pa Lukwena</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tic</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tic pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKWENA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Tic Pa Lukwena kube ki Kwena Maber ma Luka ocoyo. Miti pa ngat ma ocoyo buk man en aye me tito kore kikore kit ma jo ma lubu Yecu Kricito onyayo kwede Kwena Maber i Jerucalem, i lobo me Judaya ki i Camaria, wa ibut lobo mukene mapatpat 1:8. Buk man keken aye tito kit ma Kwena Maber pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ocako nya kwede oromo wilobo ducu. Dok ngat ma ocoyo buk man onyutu kamaleng ni Lukricitayo gin obedo jo ma pe yenyo loc me lobo man, piman gin pe gukelo kit ayela mo wa ki acel ikom loc pa jo Roma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk me Tic pa Lukwena bene kipoko iye i dul adek madongo, ma nyutu kamaleng kit ma Kwena Maber ma mako kom Yecu Kricito onya kwede i kabedo ducu mapatpat: (1) Cake pa dul pa Lukricitayo ki i Jerucalem inge dok pa Yecu iwi Polo; (2) Nya pa dul man i lobo Palicitina; (3) Nya pa dul pa Lukricitayo i kabedo ma orumu nam Mediterranean nio kwede wa i Roma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Gin ma onyute kamaleng i buk man me Tic pa Lukwena en aye tic pa Cwiny Maleng ma obino ki tek mere ikom luye ducu ma oye Yecu i Jerucalem inino me Pentekote, ki Cwiny Maleng omede ki tiro luye iticgi ducu bene kun jingo cwiny lutela i gin ducu ma kicoyo i buk man. Kwena Maber ma cegocego ma nonge i buk man en aye Kwena Maber ma kibedo katito ne i kabedo mapatpat. Dong gin ma obedo katime i buk man nyutu tek matye ilok me Kwena Maber pa Yecu Kricito ikwo pa jo ma guye kacel ki inywako me Kanica.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Yube me miyo caden <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Cik ki cike me agiki pa Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Yero lale katyen Juda <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Caden ma ki i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Caden ma ki i Judaya ki i Camaria <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic pa Paulo ka mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Wot mukwongo pa Paulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Kacoke madit i Jerucalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Wot me aryo pa Paulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:23">15:36—18:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Wot me adek pa Paulo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:24-21:16">18:24—21:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">e. Paulo lamabuc i Jerucalem, Cecaria, ki i Roma <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu ociko pi bino pa Cwiny Maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luk 1:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ladit Teopilo, I buk mukwongo acoyo iye lok ducu mayam Yecu ocako tiyo ki pwonyone, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />nio kwede wa inino ma kitere kwede woko ipolo. Ma peya kitinge malo en omiyo cik ki tek pa Cwiny Maleng bot lukwenane mayam oyerogi. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Pi nino pyere angwen en kong obedo ka nen botgi tyen mapol pi moko ni etye makwo ki inge tone. Gin gunene kun en opwonyogi ki lok ikom ker pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luk 24:49</ref></char></note> Ikare ma en obedo kwedgi, ci ocikogi ni pe gua ki i Jerucalem, ento gukur gin ma Lubanga Won ociko pire, kun waco botgi ni: <char style="wj">“Man aye gin macon wuwinyo ki botani.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Jon 1:33</ref></char></note> <char style="wj">Jon yam batija dano ki pii, ento odong nino manok mo ma wun kibibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleng.”</char><verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitingo Yecu kitero malo i polo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ka lukwenane gucoke kacel, ci gupenye ni, “Rwot, ikare man en aye ibidwoko iye ker bot jo Icrael bo?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Ci Yecu ogamo ni, <char style="wj">“Pe wun aye myero wunge kare wa ki nino mayam Lubanga Won omoko ite twer mere.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47">Luk 24:47</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:48">48</ref> </char></note> <char style="wj">Ento wun wubilimo tek ka Cwiny Maleng bibino ikomwu, ci wubibedo lucadena i Jerucalem, i Judaya ducu ki i Camaria, nio wa i agiki lobo ducu.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50">Luk 24:50</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:51">51</ref></char></note> Ka dong otyeko loko lok meno, ci kitinge kitere malo i polo, ma gin bene gineno, ci pol ogame woko ki inyimgi. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ka onongo pud guciko wanggi malo i kore ma kun en cito, ci nen, jo aryo gucung ka ngetgi ma guruku kanyi mata. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Ci guwaco botgi ni, “Wun Lugalilaya, pingo wucung wuneno malo ipolo? Yecu man ma dong kitingo malo ki botwu kitere malo ipolo, bidwogo doki kit macalo wuneno kitere kwede ipoloni.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lale katyen Juda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ka dong lukwena gucako dok i Jerucalem ki iwi got Jeituni, ma coke ki Jerucalem, rom ki wot me ceng Cabit. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1:12 </char> <char style="fk">Wot me Ceng Cabit </char> bore cok romo mairo acel. </note> <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luk 6:14-16</ref></char></note> Ka gudonyo i taun madit ci gucito i kicika malo, kama yam gibedo iyenu. Gin aye Petero ki Jon ki Yakobo ki Anderiya, Pilipo ki Tomaci, Bartolomayo ki Matayo, Yakobo wod pa Alipayo, Cimon mayam obedo ikin jo ma gimito locken, ki Juda wod pa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Gin ducu gumiine kalega ki cwiny acel, kacel ki mon ki Maliam min Yecu ki omegine.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Ikare meno Petero ocung ikin lwak utmego ma giromo miya acel ki pyere aryo kun waco ni, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Utmego, lok magi kicoyo i ginacoya myero ocobe kakare, macalo yam Cwiny Maleng oloko ki i dog Daudi ikom Juda ma otelo wi jo ma gumako Yecu ca. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Pien yam kikwano en ikinwa, en bene obedo i dog tic man. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mat 27:3-8</ref></char></note> (Dano meno owilo poto ki lim ma onongo pi tim aranyine, ka opoto aryeba cwiny ci iye otyer obar woko, cin iye owuke woko ducu. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Lok man ongene bot jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ci poto meno kilwongo ki i lebgi ni Akeldama, ma teloke ni, Poto me Remo.” )<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:25">Jab 69:25</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:8">Jab 109:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci Petero omedo loke kun waco ni, “Loke kicoyo i buk me Jabuli ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Wek kabedone obake woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">wek ngat mo pe obed iye.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Dok kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Dog tice myero ngat mukene oter.’”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />“Piman myero kiyer dano man ki ikin jo ma gubedo kwedwa ikare ducu ma Rwot Yecu obedo kawire ikinwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mat 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:51">Luk 24:51</ref></char></note> Nicake wa ikom batija pa Jon nio wa onyo madong kitinge kwede malo ki ikinwa; wek ngat acel ikin jo man kikwane kwedwa me bedo lacaden me cer mere.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ci gukelo dano aryo. Yucepu ma kilwongo Barcaba ma nyinge mukene Yucito, ki Matiya. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ka gucako lega kun giwaco ni, “Rwot ma ingeyo cwiny dano ducu, nyut botwa ikin jo man aryoni ngat ma in dong iyero, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />me leyo kabedo me tic man me tero kwena, mayam Juda oweko oloke ci odok cen, en odok gire i kabedone.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ka gubolo kwir pirgi, ci kwir opoto ikom Matiya, ci kiketo en, ka gumede ikom wel lukwena apar wiye aceli.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bino pa Cwiny Maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Nwo 16:9-11</ref></char>
    </note> Ka nino me Pentekote dong oromo, ci jo muye Kricito ducu onongo gucoke kacel i kabedo acel. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Cutcut wo owinye kun oa ki ipolo macalo yamo ma kodo mager, ci opongo i ot ducu kama gubedo iye. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Ci gin mo onen botgi macalo leb mac ma opoke ci opye iwi ngat acel acel ma ikin gi. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ka dong gin ducu gupong ki Cwiny Maleng, ci gucako loko leb mukene mapatpat macalo Cwiny Maleng omiyogi me lokone.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Onongo tye Lujudaya ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ki jo ma giworo Lubanga ma gua i rok ducu matye iwi lobo. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ka wo meno owinye, ci lwak ducu gucoke kun wigi ocung woko, pien onongo ngat acel acel winyogi ka giloko leb tugi kikome. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ci guuru matek tutwal ma kun giwaco ni, “Jo ma giloko ni mono pe gin ducu Lugalilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Pingo wan ducu dok wawinyogi kun ngat acel acel tye kalok i lebwa kikome ma kinywalowa iye? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wan Lupartia, jo Media, jo Elam, ki jo ma gibedo i Mecopotamia, Judaya ki Kapadokia, Ponto ki Acia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Purugia ki Pampulia, Ejipt ki lobo Libya ma dok tung Cirene, ki welo ma gua ki i Roma ma gin Lujudaya ki jo ma guloke gudonyo i diniwa, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Lukurete ki Luarab, wan ducu wawinyogi ka kitito pi tic madito me twero pa Lubanga i leb tuwa kikome.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Gin ducu guuru loke pien pe gitwero niang, ma guloko loke keken gi ni, “Man teloke ango?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ento jo mukene gunyerogi anyera kun giwaco ni, “Joni gumer ki kongo bwino manyen.”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Petero otito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ento Petero ocung kacel ki lukwena apar wiye acel, ci odange ki dwon madit kun waco botgi ni, “Wun co me Judaya, ki wun jo ducu ma wubedo i Jerucalem, ber wunge lok man, dok wucik itwu kawinyo loka. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Jo man pe gumer, macalo wun wutamo, pien cawa pud adek keken me odiko. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ento man aye lok mayam lanebi Joel oloko pire kun waco ni, Lubanga owaco ni,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Joe 2:28-32</ref> </char>
    </note> ‘Ikare me agiki abionyo Cwiny mera Maleng ikom jo ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">lutino awobewu ki anyirawu gibitucu lok nebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">awobewu gibineno ginanyuta,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">jowu ma otii gibileko lek.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Eyo, ikare meno abionyo Cwiny mera</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">wa ikom lutica ma co ki ma mon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">ci gibitucu lok nebi.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Abinyutu tango malo ipolo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ki lanyut mapatpat piny iwi lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">remo ki mac ki yito ma duny.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ceng bicido woko macol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">dwe bidoko makwar calo remo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ma nongo nino pa Rwot peya obino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">nino madit ki me deyo madwong.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ikare meno jo ducu ma gilwongo nying Rwot kibilarogi.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Wun Jo Icrael, wuwiny lok man: Yecu Lanajaret obedo dano ma Lubanga aye onyutu botwu kun moko ki tic madito me twer, ki tango ki lanyut mapol ma Lubanga otiyo kacel kwede ikinwu, macalo wun wungeyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Mat 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luk 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Jon 19:18</ref></char></note> Yecu man ma kimiyo botwu macalo Lubanga yam onongo oyubu kun ongeyo gin ma bitime i anyim, ci wun wugure ikom yatariya, wuneke ki cing lubalo. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5">Mat 28:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luk 24:5</ref></char></note> Ento Lubanga ocero en woko, kun gonye woko ki i arem me to, pien to pe twero moko ikome. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Jab 16:8-11</ref></char></note> Pien Daudi yam oloko ikome ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Aneno Rwot tye kweda Kare ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">pe kibidira woko cen, pien en tye tung cinga ma lacuc.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Pimeno omiyo abedo ki yomcwiny madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">leba bene loko ki yomcwiny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">nino ducu abedo maber kun atye ki gen.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Pien in pe ibitenya ata i lobo pa jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">pe ibiweko kom danoni ma geni top woko.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />In dong inyuta yo ma tera i kwo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">bedoni kweda bimiyo abedo ki yomcwiny madwong mada.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Utmega jo Icrael, omyero alok botwu ikom kwarowa Daudi atir ni yam en oto dok kiyiko kome, watye ki lyele botwa kany nio wa tin. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Jab 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Cam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref></char></note> Onongo yam en lanebi, ci ongeyo ni Lubanga yam okwongo kwong bote ni ebiketo dano mo ma ikin likwaye ma bedo iwi komkere. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />En yam oneno gin ma bitime i anyim ka oloko bene ikom cer pa Kricito ma Lubanga oyero ni, pe kitenye ata i lobo pa jo ma oto, kome bene pe otop. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Man en Yecu ma Lubanga ocero woko, wan ducu wacaden ikom lok meno. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ka kitinge malo wek obed inget Lubanga tung acuc i kabedo me deyo, ci ogamo Cwiny Maleng ki bot wone kit mayam Lubanga ociko, ci oonyo ikomwa gin man madong wuneno dok bene wuwinyoni. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref></char></note> Pien Daudi yam pe ocito ipolo; ento en aye owaco ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Rwot owaco bot Rwoda ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Bed ingeta tung acuc i kabedo me deyo,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />nio ka abimiyo lukwori doko kom laten tyeni.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Myero jo me ot pa Icrael ducu gunge atika ni, Lubanga otyeko keto en me bedo Rwot dok Kricito ma Lubanga oyere, en Yecu man ma wun wuguru ikom yatariya ni.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ka guwinyo man, cwinygi oton, ci guwaco bot Petero ki lukwena mukene ni, “Utmego, wabitimo ango?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Ci Petero owaco botgi ni, “Wungut, wek kibatijawu ngat acel acel ki ikinwu inying Yecu Kricito, wek Lubanga owek balwu; ci omiwu Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Pien lok man kiciko pirwu ki pir lutinowu ki pir jo ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa bilwongogi bote.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Ka dok otito botgi lok mukene mapol, ma tucu matek dok cuko cwinygi kun waco ni, “Wulare kenwu wua woko ki bot yalwak man mungaki wek wubwot ki i pwod ma bibino ikomgi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ci jo muye lok ma en owaco botgi kibatijagi, ci gumede inino meno jo maromo alip adek. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Gin gumine ken gi kawinyo pwony pa lukwena, ki ribe kacel ki jo ma guye Yecu, ki nywako kacel icamo mugati ki kalega.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo ikin jo ma guye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Ci lworo omako dano ducu; ci lukwena gubedo katiyo lwak tango ki lanyut mapol. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Tic 4:32-35</ref></char></note> Jo ma guye Yecu gumede ki coke kacel, kun ginywako jami ducu kacel. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Gucato lonyogi ki jamigi, ka gupoko ki jo ducu kit macalo mite bot ngat acel acel. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Nino ducu gubedo kacoke i Ot pa Lubanga ki nywako kacel icamo mugati i pacogi, kun gicamo kacel ki yomcwiny ki cwiny acel, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />kun gipako Lubanga, ma dano ducu pwoyogi, ci Lubanga obedo ka medo ikomgi jo ma gulare nino ducu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Petero ocango laput</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Inino mo acel Petero ki Jon gucito i Ot pa Lubanga i cawa me lega, ikom cawa abongwen. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Onongo tye dano mo ma laput nia ikare ma kinywale. Ma kitingo nino ducu kiketo idogola Ot pa Lubanga ma kilwongo ni Dogola ma Mwonya, pi lego kony ki bot jo ma gidonyo i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ka en oneno Petero ki Jon kun gimito donyo i Ot pa Lubanga, ci en olegogi ni gumiye kony. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Ka Petero kacel ki Jon guciko wangi ikome, ci Petero owaco ni, “Nen komwa.” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Ci oketo cwinye ka nenogi, kun geno ni gibimiye gin mo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Ento Petero owace ni, “Pe atye ki lim mo, ento amii gin ma atye kwede; inying Yecu Kricito Lanajaret, a malo i woti.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Ka omako bade lacuc ci otinge kwede malo; ci tyene ki odilo tyene ocako ojing omoko woko matek cut. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Ci laputi oa, otire ocung, owoto odonyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, ma woto kun pye, dok pako Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Lwak jo mapol ducu gunene ka woto kun pako kwede Lubanga, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />ci guniang ni en dano mayam lego kony i Dogola ma Mwonyani. Guuru matek ma doggi otwo woko pi gin ma otime ikomeni.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Petero otito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ka pud omoko ikom Petero ki Jon, ci lwak dano ducu guringo gucoke botgi ite baraja ma kilwongo ni Baraja pa Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ka Petero onenogi, ci owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun jo Icrael wuuru lok man pingo? Pingo wuciko wangwu ikomwa calo wan aye ma watiyo lok man ki tekwa, nyo ni pien wan wa bedo jo ma lworo Lubanga omiyo dano ni owoto? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Nia 3:15</ref></char></note> Lubanga pa Abraim, ki pa Icaka ki pa Yakobo, Lubanga pa kwarowa, yam oketo deyo ikom latice Yecu ma wun wumiyo i cing Pilato kun wukwere woko ikare ma Pilato oyube me gonyo en. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Mat 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luk 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Jon 19:12-15</ref></char></note> Ento wun wukwero en Ngat Maleng ma Kite Atir, kun wulego ni Pilato ogony omii botwu laneko. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ci wuneko ngat mamiyo kwo. Ento Lubanga ocere woko ki ikin jo ma oto, wan lucaden ikom lok man. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Pi tek matye inyinge, ki pi ye nyinge, en aye omiyo kom laco man ojing odoko tek macalo wuneno dok wungeyo; pi ye Yecu omiyo laco man olimo yotkom inyimwu ducu.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Eyo, utmega, angeyo ni yam wutimo man ma onongo wukwiya, macalo luditowu bene. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ento kit macalo yam Lubanga oloko i dog lunebine ducu ni Kricito mere myero onen can, ci dong omiyo loke ocobe kakare kumeno. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Piman dong wungut, wudwog cen bot Lubanga, wek balwu kijwa woko, wek nino me yweyo ma a ki bot Rwot obino botwu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Wek wunong keru me cwiny inyim Rwot, ci en bicwalo botwu odoco Kricito ma oyero pirwu, en aye Yecu, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />ma myero kijole ipolo nio ka kare oromo me roco jami ducu kakare, mayam Lubanga oloko pire i dog lunebine maleng nia wa con. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nwo 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> Moses yam owaco ni, ‘Rwot Lubanga bicwalo lanebi mo pirwu ma bia ki ikin utmegiwu macalo ocwalo an. Wubiwinyo en i lok ducu ma bititiwu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Nwo 18:19</ref></char></note> Dok ka obinen, dano mo ma pe biwinyo lanebi meno, kibipoke woko ki ikin jo pa Lubanga, ci kibityeke wange birwenyo woko ki ikin lutugi.’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Ci Petero omede ki titoni, lwak lunebi ducu yam guloko lok kun gitito pi gin ma bitime ikare man, cake wa ikom Camuel ki jo ma gulubu kore. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Aca 22:18</ref></char></note> Wun aye jo mujolo gin ma Lubanga ociko nia ki i dog lunebi, dok wun aye lule gicike mayam Lubanga omiyo bot kwariwu, kun waco bot Abraim ni, ‘Rok ducu gibilimo gumgi ki ikom likwayi.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ka dong Lubanga otyeko keto latice, ci okwongo cwale botwu pi keliwu gum mamiyo ngat acel acel loke weko timo bal.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kitero Petero ki Jon inyim jo me Otkot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Ka Petero ki Jon pud gitye kalok ki dano, ci ajwaki ki ladit maloyo acikari me Ot pa Lubanga ki Lucadukayo gubino botgi. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Gin onongo igi pe yom, pien onongo Lukwena aryoni gipwonyo lwak kun gititoni Yecu ocer ki ikin jo ma oto, kitmeno bene jo ma oto gibicer. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ka gumakogi ci guketogi ibuc nio wa odiko, pien onongo piny dong oyutu woko. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ento lwak jo mapol ki ikin jo ma guwinyo lokgi guye, ci wel dano omede oo kakine alip abic.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Ka piny oru, ci lulocgi ki ludongo ki Lupwonycik gucoke i Jerucalem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />kacel ki Anac ma ajwaka madit, ki Kayapa ki Jon ki Alekijanda, ki lwak ducu ma gitye i dogola pa ajwaki madito. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Ka kiketogi idyere, ci gupenyogi ni, “Wun wutiyo man pi kit tek ango, nyo pi nying anga?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ka Petero opong ki cwiny Maleng, ci owaco bot ludongo ki lulo lwak ni: <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />“Ka tin kipenyowa lok mudok ikom gin maber ma otime ikom laput, ki kit ma dano man ocang kwede, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />ci wek ongene botwu ducu ki bot lwak jo Icrael ducu ni, pi nying Yecu Kricito Lanajaret, ma wun wuguru ikom yatariya, ma Lubanga ocero woko ki ikin jo ma otoni aye laco man ocung inyimwu ma kome yot. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Jab 118:22</ref></char></note> Yecu aye ngat mayam kicoyo i ginacoya ni: ‘Man aye got ma wun lugedo wukwero woko ento ma odoko got madit mapire tek.’ <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Pe tye lare i ngat mo mukene, pien pe tye nying mo mukene iwi lobo man ma kimiyo ki wan dano ma myero walare iye.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ka dong ludito Otkot guneno tekcwiny pa Petero ki Jon, ma guniang bene ni gin jo mogo ata ma pe gupwonye, ci guuru; ka dong guniang ni gin yam bene gubedo kacel ki Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ento ka guneno laco ma kicangoni ocung ka ngetgi, ci lok mo marac ma myero guwac dong obedo peke. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ka guciko Petero ki Jon ni kong gukat woko ki i Otkot, ci guyubu lok keken gi, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />kun giwaco ni, “Wabitimo jo man ningning?” Dok guloko keken gi ni, “Pien dong gutyeko tiyo lanyut ma kome nen bot dano ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem, wan bene pe watwero kwerone. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ento pi kit me juku lok man wek pe oket orom kin dano, ber wajukugi ni pe gumede ki tito bot ngat mo i nying Yecu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ci gulwongogi ka gucikogi ni pe gutit dok bene pe gupwony lok mo inying Yecu kadi matidi mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ento Petero ki Jon gugamo ni, “Wun aye wungol kace nen ber iwang Lubanga me winyowu makato winyo Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Pien wan pe watwero weko tito pi gin mayam waneno ki ma wawinyo.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ka dong guburugi matek, ci guwekogi gucito; pien pe gunongo kit yo mo keken me keto can ikomgi pi lwak dano, pien gin ducu gubedo ka pako Lubanga pi gin ma otimeni. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Dano ma lanyut me twer me cango dano otime ikomeni onongo dong mwaka me dite kato ka pyere angwen woko.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma guye Yecu gulego pi tekcwiny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ka kigonyo Petero ki Jon, ci gucito bot luremgi ka gutito botgi gin ma ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo guwaco botgi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:6">Nek 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Jab 146:6</ref></char></note> Ka guwinyo, ci gulego ki dwon gi malo kacel bot Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, in mayam icweyo polo ki lobo ki gigu ducu matye i igi, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1">Jab 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 2:2">2</ref></char></note> con iloko i dog kwarowa Daudi ma latici i tek pa Cwiny Maleng ma owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Pingo Lurok gudoko ger,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">dok pingo rok mapol gipiro lok ma konye peke?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Luker me lobo guyube pi lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">ki luloc bene gucoke gugure kacel ikom Rwot ki ikom ngat ma en oyero ka dong owiro.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Luk 23:7-11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luk 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Jon 18:28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:29">29</ref></char>
    </note> Adada Kerode ki Pontio Pilato, kacel ki Lurok ki jo Icrael ducu gucoke kun gugure kacel i gang man ikom latici maleng twal Yecu, en ma in iwiro ki moo. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Gin gugure pi tiyo gin ducu mayam iyubu pi tweroni ki miti ni myero otime. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Eyo, Rwot, dong inen bura megi, ci imii wan lutici watit loki ki tekcwiny labongo lworo mo. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Dong iryeyo cingi me cango dano, wek lanyut ki tango mapol otime inying latici maleng twal en Yecu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ka gutyeko lega, ci kabedo ma gugure iyeni oyenge, gin ducu gupong ki Cwiny Maleng, ci gutito lok pa Lubanga ki tekcwiny labongo lworo.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luye gunywako jami ducu kacel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">Tic 2:44</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:45">45</ref></char>
    </note> Lwak jo ma oye ducu gubedo ki cwiny acel ki tam acel, kun pe tye ngat mo ma waco ni lim ma etye kwede ni mere kene, ento gunywako jamigi ducu kacel. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Lukwena gutito cadengi ma moko lok ikom cer pa Yecu ki tek, ci Lubanga onyo gum madit opoto ikomgi ducu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Pe tye ngat mo ikin gi ma gin mo orem ki bote, pien jo ma gitye ki potigi nyo odigi gucatogi woko, ka gukelo lim ma oa iye, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />guketo ka tyen lukwena kun miyo botgi, ka gupoko kit ma mite bot ngat acel acel. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kitmeno Yucepu ma Lalevi ma kinywalo i Caiprac, ma nyinge me aryone lukwena gucako ni Barnaba (ma te loke ni ngat ma jingo cwiny dano), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />ocato potone ma en tye kwede, ci okelo lime oketo ka tyen lukwena kun miyo botgi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Anania ki dakone Capira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ento laco mo ma nyinge Anania ki dakone Capira gucato jamigi. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ci en okano dul lim mogo woko ma dakone bene ngeyo, ka okelo dul acel mukene, ci oketo ka tyen lukwena. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Ento Petero owace ni, “Anania, pingo Catan opongo cwinyi, omiyo ibwolo Cwiny Maleng kun ikano but dul lim ma oa ingomi? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ma onongo pe icato ngomi, onongo pe obedo meri giri? Dok madong icato, pe onongo tye giri ite twero ni? Pingo itamo lok macalo meno i cwinyi? Pe ibwolo dano ento ibwolo Lubanga giri!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ka Anania owinyo lok meno, ci en opoto piny oto woko cut, ci lworo madit omako jo ducu ma guwinyo pire. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ci awobe mogo gua ci guboyo kome, ka gutere woko ka yike.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Lacen ka cawa okato kine ka adek, ci dakone Capira obino odonyo i kacoke, kun pe ngeyo gin ma otime ikom cware. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Ci Petero owace ni, “Tita ka onongo wucato ngomwu i wel marom man.” Ci en ogamo ni, “Eyo,” wacato, “iwel ma rom meno.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Ento Petero owace ni, “Pingo wun aryo ducu wuribe ka bwolo Cwiny pa Rwot? Nen, tyen jo muyiko cwari ka tye i dogola, in bene gibiteri woko.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ci dakonu opoto piny katyene, oto woko cut, ka awobe gubino gudonyo i ot, ci gunongo en oto, ci gutere woko, guyike ka nget cware. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Lworo madit omako lwak jo ma oye Yecu ducu, ki jo ducu ma guwinyo loke.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lanyut ki tango mapol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Lwak lanyut ki tango mapol otime ikin dano ki i cing lukwena. Onongo luye gin ducu girwate kacel igure matye ite Baraja pa Solomon. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Pe tye ngat mo ma pe igure gi ma oete me ribe kwedgi, ento kadi bed kumeno onongo dano guketo woro madit ikomgi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Ci lwak jo mapol ma guye gumede ikom jo ma gujolo Rwot, man gubedo co wa ki mon. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Dong malube ki gin ma lukwena gubedo katiyone, dano onongo gikelo lutwo wa i yoo, ma gipyelogi iwi kitanda ki iwi kabutu, wek ka Petero kato ka ngetgi, ci tipune owok ikom jo mogo ikin gi. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Lwak dano bene gua ki i taun murumu Jerucalem, ci gucoke kun gikelo lutwo ki jo ma cen maracu yelogi, ci gin ducu gulimo nicang.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiunu lukwena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ento ajwaka madit oa kacel ki jo ma gitye kwede, ma gin aye dul pa Lucadukayo, ma nyeko onongo makogi matek, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />ci gucako mako lukwena guketogi ibuc. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ento idyewor lamalaika pa Rwot oyabo dogola me ot buc, ci okelogi woko kun waco ni, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Wucit wucung i Ot pa Lubanga, wutit bot dano lok me kwo manyen man ducu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Ka guwinyo lok man, ci gudonyo i Ot pa Lubanga kwarpiny ci gubedo ka pwonyo dano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ka ajwaka madit obino ki jo ma onongo gitye kwede, ci gucoko Luotkot kacel ki ludongo ducu pa jo Icrael, ka gucwalo kwena ka omogi ki ibuc. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ento ka ludito pa acikari gucito, pe gunongogi ibuc, ka gudwoko lok ni, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Wanongo ot buc giloro maber, kun lukur piny bene gucung i dogola, ento ka wayabo ci pe wanongo ngat mo iye.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ka ladit pa acikari me Ot pa Lubanga ki ajwaka madit guwinyo lok meno, ci tamgi ocung woko, kun gipenye keken gi kit gin ango ma otime ikom lukwena. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ka ngat mo obino otitigi ni, “Jo ma wuketogi i ot buc ni, gitye gucung i Ot pa Lubanga ka pwonyo dano.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ci ladit ki acikarine gucito gukelogi, ento pe ki tek mo, pien onongo gilworo ni lwak bicelogi ki got.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ka dong gukelogi, ci guketogi inyim Luotkot, ka ajwaka madit openyogi, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27:25</ref></char></note> kun waco ni, “Wan wacikowu matek ni pe wupwony lok mo inying man ento koni wun wukeyo lok man wupong i Jerucalem woko pi pwonywuni, dok wumoko tamwu me kelo remo pa dano man ikomwa.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ento Petero ki lukwena mukene gudok iye ni, “Myero wawiny Lubanga makato dano. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Lubanga pa kwarowa ocero Yecu ma wun wuneko woko kun wungabe ikom yat. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Lubanga otinge malo okete malo tung acuc i kabedo me deyo pi bedo Laker ki Lalar, wek jo Icrael gunong kare me ngut ci en owek balgi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Wan aye lucaden me lok meno, kacel ki Cwiny Maleng ma Lubanga omiyo bot jo ma giwinye.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok pa Gamaliel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ka guwinyo lok man, ci gutuge ki akeca ma gimito nekogi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ento Laparicayo mo ma i Otkot ma nyinge Gamaliel, Lapwonycik ma dano ducu giworo, oa malo ci ociko ni kong kicwalgi woko pi kare manok. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ka owaco bot jo mucoke ni, “Jo Icrael, ber wugwoke i gin ma wutimo ikom jo man. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Pien yam con ikare ca Teyuda otuc ci omiine kene ni en e dano madit, ki jo mogo ma giromo ka miya angwen guribe kwede; ento kineke woko ci jo ma onongo gilube ducu guket woko ata. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Dok ingeye, Juda ma Lagalilaya dok otuc ikare me kwano wel dano, ci otero jo mukene ma gilube; en bene oto, ci jo ma gilube bene guket woko ata. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Eyo, ilok man madong tye kombedi atito botwu ni cwinywu oa woko ikom jo man, wuwek gubedi; pien kace yub man nyo tic man pa dano, ci bigik ata. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ento ka pa Lubanga, ci pe wubiloyogi, wun bene wubinen calo jo ma wulwenyo ikom Lubanga!”<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Ci gujolo tame, ka kilwongo lukwena gudwogo cen, ci gugoyogi kun kicikogi ni pe dok gulok inying Yecu, ka dong giwekogi gucito. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ci gua woko ki inyim Luotkot ma onongo cwinygi yom, pien Lubanga otamo ni gin gupore me nongo lewic pi nying Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Dok nino ducu pe guweko pwonyo dano ki tito lok me Kwena Maber ni Yecu en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero i Ot pa Lubanga ki i paco pa dano.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kiyero lukony abiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ikare meno ka wel lupwonye obedo ka mede, ci Lujudaya ma giloko leb Grik gubedo ki nguru ikom Lujudaya ma giloko leb Ibru, ni nino ducu ka kipoko lim pe giparo pi mon to gi. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ka lukwena apar wiye aryo gulwongo lupwonye ducu kacel ci guwaco botgi ni, “Pe omyero wabwot tito lok pa Lubanga pi tic me poko cam. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Pieno, utmego, wuyer ikinwu jo ma kiloko nyingi maber, en jo ma gupong ki Cwiny Maleng ki ryeko, ma myero waketgi i dog tic man. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Ento wan wabimine kalega ki tito lok.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Lokgi oyomo cwiny lwak ducu, ci guyero Citefano, en dano ma opong ki niye ki Cwiny Maleng, kacel ki Pilipo, Porokulo, Nikanori, Timon, Parmena, ki Nikolao ma en aye dano me Antiokia mayam oloke i dini pa Lujudaya. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ci kiketogi inyim lukwena, ka dong lukwena gulego ci guketo cinggi iwigi.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ci lok pa Lubanga omede ki nya; ki wel lupwonye bene onya omede madwong tutwal i Jerucalem, ki lwak ajwaki pa Lubanga mapol bene gujolo niye.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimako Citefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ka Citefano opong ki kica ki teko pa Lubanga, obedo katiyo tango ki lanyut ikin lwak. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ci jo mogo ma gua ki i kacoke ma kilwongo ni kacoke pa jo ma kigonyogi ki i opii, kacel ki jo mogo me Cirene ki me Alekijanderia, ki jo ma gua Cilicia ki Acia, gubedo ka pyem ki Citefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ento ryekone oloyogi, pien loko ki tek pa Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ci gupiyo dano i mung kun giwaco ni, “Wawinyo en kaloko kun yeto Moses ki Lubanga.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ci gutugu lwak ki ludongo ki Lupwonycik, ka gubino gumake ci gutere inyim Luotkot. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Ci gukelo lucaden me goba ma giwaco ni, “Laco man pe weko loko lok marac ma kemo kabedo man maleng ki Cik pa Moses. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Wan wabedo kawinyo en ka loko ni Yecu man me Najaret bimuku ot man woko, ka dok biloko Cik ma Moses omiyowa me aluba.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Ci jo ducu ma gubedo i Otkot guciko wangi ikome, ci guneno wange calo wang lamalaika.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Pido Pa Citefano inyim Luotkot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ka ajwaka madit openyo Citefano ni, “Lok man tye kitmeno?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Aca 12:1</ref></char></note> Ci Citefano ogamo ni, “Omegina ki wegina, wuwinya. Lubanga me deyo yam onyute bot kwarowa Abraim ma onongo pud tye wa i Mecopotamia, ma peya obedo i Karan. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ci owace ni, ‘Aa woko ki i lobowu ki ikin wat ma meri, icit i lobo ma abinyuti.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Aca 11:31</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:4">Aca 12:4</ref></char></note> Ka dong oa woko ki i lobo pa jo Kaldaya, ci obedo i Karan, ka lacen wone oto, ci Lubanga okwanyo en ki kunu, ci okele wa i lobo man ma koni wubedo iye ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aca 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> Ento pe omiye oleyo dul lobo mo kany, kadi wa mo marom ki tyen dano, ento ocike me miyo bote me bedo lobone ki pa likwaye ma gibilube, kadi bed onongo latine mo pud peke. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Aca 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 15:14">14</ref></char></note> Ci Lubanga owaco bote ni, ‘Likwayi gibibedo i lobo pa jo mukene ma kibilokogi gibedo opii, kibitimogi marac pi mwaka miya angwen.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Nia 3:12</ref></char></note> Ka Lubanga owaco ni, ‘Abimiyo pwod ikom jo ma biunugi, ci lacen gibia ki kunu, ci gibiwora i kabedo man.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Aca 17:10-14</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">Aca 21:2-4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:26">Aca 25:26</ref></char></note> Ci omiyo ki Abraim gicike me lire. Kitmeno Abraim onywalo Icaka ci oliro en inino me aboro me dite; ki Icaka onywalo Yakobo, ki Yakobo onywalo kwariwa apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Aca 37:11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Aca 37:28</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:2">Aca 39:2</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char>
    </note> Nyeko omako kwariwa ikom Yucepu, ci gucate woko i Ejipt, ento Lubanga onongo tye kwede. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Aca 41:39-41</ref></char></note> Ci olare ki i can ducu, ka omiye gum ki ryeko inyim Parao, rwot me Ejipt, ma oketo en me bedo laloc maloyo lobo Ejipt ki jami ma i ot pa rwot ducu. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1">Aca 42:1</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 42:2">2</ref></char></note> Ikare ma kec opoto i lobo Ejipt ducu ki i Kanaan, okelo can madwong ma omiyo kit me nongo cam oloyo kwariwa woko. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ento ka Yakobo owinyo ni ngano tye i Ejipt, ci ocwalo kwariwa kunu tyen ma okwongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Aca 45:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:16">Aca 45:16</ref></char></note> Ka dong gudok tyen me aryo, ci Yucepu onyute kekene bot omegine ci Parao ongeyo kaka pa Yucepu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9">Aca 45:9</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:10">10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:17">17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 45:18">18</ref></char></note> Ka Yucepu ocwalo dano kalwongo wone Yakobo, ki wadigi ducu, dano weng pyere abiro wiye abic. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobo ocito i Ejipt, ci oto woko, en kikome ki kwariwa ducu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Aca 46:1-7</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Aca 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yoc 24:32</ref></char></note> Ci kitingo komgi kidwoko cen i Cekem ci kiyikogi i lyel mayam Abraim owilo ki lim ryal ki bot awobe pa Kamor i Cekem.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Nia 1:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ento ka kare ma kiciko onyiko cok, mayam Lubanga omiyo bot Abraim, ci jowa gumede ki nya i Ejipt, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />nio ka kiketo rwot mo mukene ma pe ngeyo Yucepu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10">Nia 1:10</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 1:11">11</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:22">Nia 1:22</ref></char></note> En ongolo ryeko ikom kakawa, ci odiyo kwariwa me bolo lutinogi wek guto woko. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Nia 2:2</ref></char></note> Ikare meno en aye kinywalo iye Moses. En onongo mwonya mada, ci kibedo ka pite i ot pa wone pi dwe adek. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Nia 2:3-10</ref></char></note> Ikare ma kikane woko i dog kulu, ci nya pa Parao ononge ci ojule macalo wode kikome. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ci Moses kipwonyo ki ryeko ducu pa Luejipt; ci en obedo laco adada i loke ki i tice.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Nia 2:11-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka dong mwaka me dite oromo pyere angwen, ci tam obino i cwinye me limo wadine, ma gin Jo Icrael. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Ka Moses oneno ngat acel ikin gi kitimo marac, ci okonyo dano ma kibwoyo ni, ka oculu kwor ogoyo Laejipt. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />En yam otamo ni gwok nyo omegine gingeyo ni Lubanga oyubu ni kibilarogi pi tice, ento pe guniang. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Dok orwone otuc botgi ma onongo Luicrael aryo gi da ikin gi; onongo en mito ribo kin gi, ci owaco botgi ni, ‘Wun omego, pingo wutime marac kekenwu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ento latim lawote maraci ocwale cen kun waco ni, ‘Anga ma oketo in me bedo langolkop ki lalowa? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />In i mito neka kit ma laworo ineko Laejipt ni?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:15b-21">Nia 2:15b-21</ref></char></note> Ci Moses oringo woko pi lok meno, ka ocito odoko labedo i lobo Midian, ci onywalo iye lutino awobe aryo.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Nia 3:1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka mwaka okato pyere angwen, ci lamalaika onen bote i tim ma inget got Cinai i leb mac ma lyel i caka. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Ka Moses oneno, ci ouru kite. Ka onyiko cok kaneno, ci dwon obino ni, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘An Lubanga pa kwariwu, Lubanga pa Abraim, ki pa Icaka, ki pa Yakobo.’ Ci kom Moses omyel, lworo ogenge nenone woko. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ka Rwot owaco bote ni, ‘Luny war woko ki i tyeni, pien kabedo ma in icung iyeni ngom maleng. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Adada an dong aneno atwom pa jona ma gitye i Ejipt, awinyo wa cur meggi, an dong alor piny ka larogi. Bin dong acwali i Ejipt.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Nia 2:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note> En Moses aceli mayam gukwero wokoni kun gipenye ni, ‘Anga muketo in me bedo lalowa ki langolkopwa?’ En aye Lubanga ocwale macalo laloc ki lalar ki i cing lamalaika ma onen bote i cakani. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Nia 7:3</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Nia 14:21</ref></char></note> Ci okwanyogi woko ki i Ejipt kun tiyo tango ki lanyut mapol i Ejipt ki i Nam Makwar ki i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Nwo 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> Moses man aye ceng otito bot Jo Icrael ni, ‘Lubanga bicwalo lanebi pirwu ma bia ki ikin utmegiwu macalo ocwalo an ni.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Nia 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Nwo 5:1-33</ref></char></note> Man aye ngat ma onongo yam tye ikin lwak ma i tim kacel ki lamalaika ma oloko kwede i got Cinai, ma oloko bene ki kwariwa; kunu en olimo iye lok ma pwonyo wa me nongo kwo ma labednaka me akela botwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Kwariwa yam gukwero winyo loke ento gucwale woko cen, dok cwinygi ogomo me dok cen i Ejipt. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Nia 32:1</ref></char></note> Ci guwaco bot Aron ni, ‘Yub ki wan lubanga ma bitelo wiwa, pien Moses man ma okwanyowa woko ki i lobo Ejipt, pe dong wangeyo kama odok iye,’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Nia 32:2-6</ref></char></note> Ci guyubu cal wod twon ikare meno, gucako tyero gitum bot cal lubanganu, ma cwinygi obedo yom ikom tic me cinggi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5:25-27</ref></char></note> Ci Lubanga oloke omiyo ki gin kare me woro lakalatwe, kit mayam kicoyo i buk pa lunebi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Wun Jo Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">yam onongo pe wuneko lee me gitum ki an aye i tim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">pi mwaka pyere angwen<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Wun yam Wutingo kema pa jok Molok aye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ki cal lakalatwe pa lubangawu ma nyinge Repan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ma gin cal jogiwu ma wuyubugi me awora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Pimeno an bene abicwalowu woko cen wa inge Babilon.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:9">Nia 25:9</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char>
    </note> Kwariwa yam gitye ki kema me caden ma nyutu pi tye pa Lubanga i tim, ma Lubanga yam oloko ki Moses ni oyubi kun lubu cal ma en oneno. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Yoc 3:14-17</ref></char></note> Gin bene gukelo kema meno ikare ma gubino ki Yocwa me leyo lobo pa rok mapol ma Lubanga oryemogi woko ki inyimgi. Dok bene kema meno obedo botgi nio kwede wa ikare pa Daudi, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Cam 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Tek 17:1-14</ref></char></note> ma olimo gum ma oa ki bot Lubanga dok openyo ni kiwek eyub kabedo pi Lubanga pa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Luk 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Tek 3:1-17</ref></char></note> Ento Solomon aye ogero ot pire.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Kadi bed kitmeno, en Ngat Mamalo Twal pe bedo i ot ma kitiyo ki cing; macalo yam lanebi owaco ni,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:49: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ica 66:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 66:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> ‘Polo aye komkera, man Rwot aye ma owaco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">ki lobo obedo kom me teno tyena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Kit ot ango ma ibigero pira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ka yweyona kono onongo bedo kwene?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Pe cinga aye otiyo lwak jami ni ducu?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Ica 63:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wun jo ma ludingo, dok bene pe wungeyo Lubanga i cwinywu, ma itwu bene oding, wun wulwenyo ki Cwiny Maleng jwijwi; macalo yam kwariwu gutiyo, wun bene wutiyo kitmeno. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Lanebi mene mayam kwariwu pe guunu? Dok guneko jo mayam gutucu con pi bino pa Ngat ma Kite Atir ni ma wun wuketo roro ikome ci wuneko woko. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Wun jo ma kimiyowu Cik pa Lubanga ma lumalaika yam gukelo, ci pe wulubu.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicelo Citefano ki got</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ka guwinyo lok meno, ci gutuge ma gukayo lakgi woko liking. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ento Citefano ma onongo opong ki Cwiny Maleng, ociko wange ipolo ci oneno deyo pa Lubanga, kun Yecu ocung inget Lubanga tung acuc. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Ci en owaco ni, “Nen, aneno polo oyabe ki Wod pa dano ocung inget Lubanga tung acuc.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ci gin gudange, kun giwoo ki dwon gi matek ma gudingo itgi woko, ci gucore ikome kacel. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Ka gubole woko inge gang, ci gucele ki got, ka lucaden gupyelo ginarukagi katyen awobi mo ma nyinge Caulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ikare ma kitye kacelo Citefano ki got, en olego ni, “Rwot Yecu, gam cwinya,” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ka orumu conge piny, ci odange ki dwone matek ni, “Rwot, pe iket bal man ikomgi.” Ka otyeko lok kit man, ci oto.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Caulo bene opwoyo tone apwoya.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Caulo ounu lwak ma oye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Inino meno kikome aye ayelayela madwong opoto kwede ikom jo ma oye Yecu ma i Jerucalem; ci gin ducu guket woko ata i lobo ducu me Judaya ki Camaria, kono lukwena keken aye gudong. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Jo ma giworo Lubanga aye guyiko Citefano, kun gukoke matek tutwal. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4">Tic 22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> Ento Caulo onongo tye katimo aranyi ikom lwak jo ma oye Kricito; kun donyo i ot ki ot ci ywayo co wa ki mon ka tweyogi ibuc.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilipo otucu Kwena Maber i Camaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Jo ducu ma guket ata guwoto kun gin tito lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Pilipo ocito i taun madit mo me Camaria ci otucu botgi pi Kricito ma Lubanga oyero. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ci lwak ma gucoke gujolo lok ma Pilipo otito botgi ki cwinygi acel ikare ma guwinyo kun gineno bene lanyut ma en otiyo. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Pien jo mapol ma cen maracu omakogi, cen oa woko ki ikomgi kun gidange ki koko matek; ki lwak lutwo akweya ki lungolo bene gucang woko. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Kitmeno yomcwiny obedo dwong i taun madit meno.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ento yam onongo tye dano mo i taun madit meno ma nyinge Cimon ma en lajok. En oweko jo me Camaria ure mada kun en waco kekene ni en e dano madit. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Gin ducu guketo cwinygi i lok ma en waco, lutino wa ludito bene, kun giwaco ni, “Man aye dano matye ki tek pa Lubanga ma kilwongo ni Maditi” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Gubedo kaketo cwinygi kawinyo loke, pien obedo kwedgi pi kare malac kun miyo giuru tim jokjokeni. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ento ka guye lok me Kwena Maber ma Pilipo otito ikom ker pa Lubanga ki ikom Yecu Kricito, ci kibatijagi, co wa ki mon. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Kadi wa Cimon bene oye, ka kibatija en ci omede obedo kacel ki Pilipo kun neno lanyut ki tango madito ma en tiyo, ci ouru mada.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ka lukwena ma gitye i Jerucalem guwinyo ni Lucamaria guye lok pa Lubanga, ci gucwalo botgi Petero ki Jon. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Gin bene ka gucito kunu, ci gulego pirgi wek gulim Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Pien onongo peya Cwiny Maleng obino ikom ngat mo ikin gi, ento yam kibatijagi inying Yecu keken. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ka guketo cinggi iwigi, ci gulimo Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ikare ma Cimon oneno ni gulimo Cwiny Maleng malube ki keto cing pa lukwena iwigi, ci okelo lim botgi <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />kun waco ni, “Wumiya tek man bene, wek an bene ka aketo cinga iwi dano mo wek olim Cwiny Maleng.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ento Petero owace ni, “Cente ni omyero orweny woko matwal, kacel ki in, pien itamo pi wilo mot pa Lubanga ki lim! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />In pe itye ki gin mo nyo dul mo i lok man, pien cwinyi pe opore inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Dong ingut ikom bali man, dok ileg Rwot, wek ka twere lok matye i cwinyini kitimi iye kica. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Pien aneno cwinyi kec calo keda, bal otweyi woko idoko lamabuce.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Ci Cimon odok iye ni, “Wuleg Rwot pira wek gin ma wuwaconi pe opot ikoma.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ka gutyeko tito lok me caden ki tucu lok pa Rwot, ci gudok i Jerucalem, kun gitito lok me Kwena Maber i paco mapol ma i Camaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilipo ki latic madit me Etiopia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ento lamalaika pa Rwot owaco ki Pilipo ni, “A iwot idok tung kupiny i yoo ma aa ki Jerucalem dok piny i Gaja.” Yoo ma wok ki i tim. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ci Pilipo oa ocito. Ci nen, laco mo ma Laetiopia, ma kikolo, oa ka woro Lubanga i Jerucalem. En onongo latic madit ma obedo ladit ma lakan jami ducu pa Candace, rwot ma dako me lobo Etiopia. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Ikare ma dok i lobo tugi, en onongo obedo i gadigadine kun kwano buk pa lanebi Icaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Cwiny Maleng owaco bot Pilipo ni cit i, “Nyik cok, irwate ki gadigadi man.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Ka Pilipo oringo bote, ci owinyo en ka kwano buk pa lanebi Icaya, ci openye ni, “In iniang lok ma ikwano ni?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Ci en ogamo ni, “Aniang ningning kono, ka ngat mo pe okonya?” Ci olwongo Pilipo ni obed kwede kacel. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ica 53:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:8">8</ref></char></note> Dul ma en obedo ka kwanone onongo tye kit man:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Calo romo ma kitero ka nekone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">nyo latin romo ma oling inyim lanyar yere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">kitmeno en pe ongamo doge kalok.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kilanye dok bene pe kingole kop ma atir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Anga matwero tito kit yalwak mere?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Pien kwone dong kikwanyo woko ki i lobo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ci laco ma kikolo owaco bot Pilipo ni, “Alegi, tita, lanebi oloko lok man ikom anga, ikome kene nyo ikom ngat mukene?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ci Pilipo ocako lok. Ocako ki lok man mayam kicoyo kun tito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Ka gumede ki wot kacel i yoo, ci guo kama pii tye iye. Ci laco man ma kikoloni owaco ni, “Nen pii dong ene! Gin ango ma genga limo batija?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Ci Pilipo owace ni, “Ka iye ki cwinyi ducu ci itwero.” En odok iye ni, “An aye Yecu Kricito, ni en Wod pa Lubanga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tyeng man peke i Baibul mukene.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ci ociko ni gadigadi omyero ocung; ci gin ducu gulor i pii, Pilipo ki laco man ma kikoloni, ci Pilipo obatija en. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Ka gukati woko ki i pii, ci Cwiny pa Rwot otingo Pilipo, otero woko. Laco man ma kikoloni pe dok onene, ci owoto wote ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ento Pilipo otuc wa i Ajota kun wire katucu lok me Kwena Maber i taun ducu nio ka obino wa i Cecaria.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Caulo oloke oye Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Tic 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ikare meno Caulo onongo pud mede ameda ki unu lupwonye pa Rwot kun mito nekogi. En ocito bot ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />ka olege waraga me cito i kacoke ducu matye i Damaciko, wek ka enongo dano ma lubu Yo pa Rwot ma gitye kunu, co wa ki mon, ci etwegi, ekelgi i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Ikare ma en pud tye kawot, madong onyiko cok ki Damaciko, ci dero oa ki ipolo oryeny ocaro kome. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Ka opoto piny ci owinyo dwon ma waco bote ni, <char style="wj">“Caulo, Caulo, iyela pingo?”</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Caulo ogamo ni, “In anga, Rwot?” Ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“An aye Yecu, ma itye ka yelone ni.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" /><char style="wj">Ento a idony i taun madit, ci kibititi gin ma omyero itii.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Jo mayam guwoto kwede gucung laling, ma kun giwinyo dwon ento pe guneno ngat mo. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Caulo oa malo ki kama opoto iye piny ingomi, ento ka oyabo wange, ci pe oneno gin mo. Ci kipeye ki cinge kikele i Damaciko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Paulo obedo nino adek ma pe neno piny pe camo dok pe mato bene.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Onongo tye lapwonye mo i Damaciko ma nyinge Anania. Rwot owace iwang lek ni, <char style="wj">“Anania.”</char> Ci en ogamo ni, “An a en, Rwot.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Anania ni, <char style="wj">“A ilub yoo ma kilwongo ni Atir, ci ipeny i ot pa Juda laco mo ma nyinge Caulo me Taruco; en kombedi tye kalega.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" /><char style="wj">En oneno dano mo ma nyinge Anania i gin anyuta ka donyo bote kun keto cinge iwiye wek wange oyabe.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ento Anania odok iye ni, “Rwot, yam awinyo lok ikom dano man ki bot jo mapol, kit ma otimo kwede joni marac i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />En obino kany bene ki twero pa ajwaki madito me mako jo ducu ma gilwongo nyingi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ento Rwot owace ni, <char style="wj">“Citi, pien en aye gin tica madong ayero pitero nyinga inyim Lurok ki luker ki jo Icrael.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" /><char style="wj">An ki koma abinyute can madwong ma en omyero ocir pi nyinga.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ci Anania oa ocito odonyo i ot. Oketo cinge iwiye kun waco ni, “Omera Caulo, Rwot Yecu ma onyute boti i wanga yoo ma i tye kabinoni ocwala boti wek wangi oyabe, wek ipong bene ki Cwiny Maleng.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ci gin mo macal ki pok rac opoto ki i wange cut, ci ocako neno piny. Ka oa malo ci kibatija en, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />ka lacen ocamo cam ci olimo teko.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Caulo otito lok ikom Yecu i Damaciko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Caulo obedo kunu pi kare manok ki lupwonye ma i Damaciko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ci ocako tucu lok ikom Yecu i kacoke cut kun waco ni, “Yecu en Wod pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Ci jo ducu ma guwinyo loke guuru, kun giwaco ni, “Man pe en aye laco mayam onongo tye ka neko jo ma gilwongo ki nying Yecu i Jerucalemi? Dok en bene obino kany pi lok meno, pi mako dano wek etergi bot ajwaki madito.” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ento teko pa Caulo omede ameda, omiyo lewic omako Lujudaya ma gibedo i Damaciko, pien en onyutu atir ni Yecu en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Caulo obwot ki i cing Lujudaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32">2 Kor 11:32</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 11:33">33</ref></char>
    </note> Ka nino okato mapol, ci Lujudaya gucoke, gupiro lok me neke. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ento Caulo owinyo pi lok ma kiyubu ni. Onongo gin kiye i dogcel me Damaciko dyeceng ki dyewor wek kineke woko. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ento lupwonyene gutinge ki aduku ki i dyewor, ci gucwale piny ki i apiding ma ikom cel. <figure style="fig" alt="Lowering Paul in busket" file="LB00333B.TIF" size="col" loc="9:25" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="9:25">Kicwalo Paulo piny ki i apiding ma ikom cel</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Caulo ocito Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ka Caulo obino oo i Jerucalem ci otemo ribe ki lupwonye; ento gin ducu gulwore, pien onongo peya guye ni en lapwonye pa Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ento Barnaba otere, ci okele bot lukwena. Ci otito botgi kit ma Caulo oneno kwede Rwot i wangayo, kun oloko kwede, ki dok bene obedo i Damaciko katito lok ki tekcwiny labongo lworo inying Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ci en obedo kawire kacel kwedgi i Jerucalem, kun bene tito lok ki tek cwiny inying Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />En oloko bene ki Lujudaya ma giloko leb Grik, kun pyem kwedgi; ento gin guyenyo yo me neke. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ka luye gungeyo loke, ci gilaro kwede i Cecaria, ci gucwale i Taruco.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Lwak ma oye Yecu ma i Judaya ducu ki Galilaya ki Camaria dong gubedo ki kuc, ci wel luye omede, kun giworo Rwot i kwogi me nino ducu. Cwiny Maleng obedo ka jingo cwinygi, dok welgi bene omede ameda.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero i Lida ki i Jopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Ikare meno Petero obedo kawire ikin gi ducu, ci ocito bot jo pa Lubanga ma gin bedo i Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kunu en onongo iye dano ma nyinge Ainea, mayam orii iwi kitanda mwaka aboro ma twoyo two akweya. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ci Petero owaco bote ni, “Ainea, Yecu Kricito cango twoni woko; a malo ipet kabutuni.” Ci otugi a malo cut. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Jo ducu ma gibedo i Lida ki Caron gunene, ci guloke bot Rwot.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />I Jopa yam onongo tye iye lapwonye mo ma dako ma nyinge Tabica, ma i leb Grik kilwongo ni Dorka. (Dorka teloke ni Lajwa.) En yam tiyo tic mabeco mapol mada, dok konyo lucan. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ikare meno two omake ci oto woko. Ka gutyeko lwoko kome ci gupyelo i kicika malo. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Macalo Lida cok ki Jopa, ka lupwonye guwinyo ni Petero tye kunu, ci gucwalo dano aryo bote, gulege ni, “Tim ber, ibin oyot botwa, pe igale.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Ci Petero oa, owoto kwedgi; ka oo kunu, ci gutere i kicika malo. Mon to ducu gucung kun gikok ka ngete, ma ginyutu koti ki bongi mukene ma Dorka okwoyo ma onongo pud tye botgi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Ento Petero ocwalogi ducu woko, ka orumu conge piny ocako lega. Lacen oloke bot lato kun waco ni “Tabica, a malo.” Ci Tabica oyabo wange; ka oneno Petero ci oa obedo abeda. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Ci Petero ocwalo cinge omake, ka okonye me a malo. Ka olwongo jo pa Lubanga ki mon to, ci omiye botgi makwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Loke oywek i Jopa ducu, ma omiyo jo mapol guye Rwot. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petero obedo i Jopa pi nino mapol i gang pa dano mo ma nyinge Cimon, lanyong pyen.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Petero gin ki Kornelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Yam onongo tye laco mo i Cecaria ma nyinge Kornelio, ladit me dul acikari ma kilwongo ni me Itali. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Laco man onongo woro Lubanga, en ki jo ma i ode ducu. En yam miyo jami mapol me konyo dano bot Lujudaya, kun lego Lubanga jwijwi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />I kine me cawa abongwen me dyeceng en oneno lamalaika pa Lubanga kun obino odonyo bote, ci olwongo nyinge iwang lek ni, “Kornelio!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kornelio ociko wange ikom lamalaika ki lworo madit, ci owaco ni, “Gin ango ba, ladit?” Ci lamalaika owaco bote ni, “Legani ki moti me kony oito malo obedo gin me po ikomi inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Kombedi dong icwal dano i Jopa, wek gucit guom Cimon ma kilwongo Petero. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />En ogony i ot pa Cimon lanyong pyen, ma ode cok ki dog nam.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ka lamalaika ma oloko kwede ni otyeko wot, ci Kornelio olwongo lutice aryo ki acikari acel ma woro Lubanga ki ikin jo ma gitiyo bote. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Ka otyeko tito botgi lok ducu, ci ocwalogi i Jopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Orwone ka gitye kawot madong gicok ki Jopa, ci Petero oito iwi ot malo kalega ikine me cawa abicel. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kec ocako neke, kun mito ni ecam gin mo, ento onongo pud kitye ka yubu cam ayuba; ci Paulo oneno gin anyuta. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />En oneno ka polo oyabe, ki jami mo olor piny, macalo cuka madit, kun bino piny matye ki twoke angwen. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Kun onongo tye iye kit kwayi lee ducu, wa kwayi anyai ducu ki winyo me polo. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ci dwon obino bote ma waco ni, <char style="wj">“Petero, a ineki wek icam.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ento Petero ogamo ni, “Pe, Rwot, peya acamo jami ata me kwer.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ci dwon dok obino bote tyen me aryone ni, <char style="wj">“Gin ma Lubanga olonyo in pe ilwong ni obedo me kwer.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Man otime tyen adek, ci jami meno kidwoko woko ipolo.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />I cawa meno ka onongo Petero pud tye kalwodo ki i cwinye kun tamo pi telok me gin anyuta man, ci jo ma Kornelio ocwalogi gubedo kapenyo pi ot pa Cimon, kun gucung i dog ot. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ci gulwongo lwongo kun gipenyo ka nyo Cimon ma kilwongo Petero ogony kenyo. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Ikare ma Petero pud tye kalwodo pi gin anyuta man, ci Cwiny Maleng owace ni, “Nen, jo adek gitye kayenyo in. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Aa, ilor piny iwot kwedgi kun pe ibed ki gung cwiny, pien an aye acwalogi.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ci Petero olor piny bot jo meno kun waco ni, “An aye ngat ma wun wuyenyoni. Wun wubino kany pingo?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ci gugamo ni, “Kornelio ma ladit me acikari en dano ma cwinye atir, dok lworo Lubanga. Jo Lujudaya ducu giloko ki nyinge maber. En oneno lamalaika maleng ma ocike ni ocwal dano boti wek icit wa i ode, wek en owiny gin ma in ibiwaco.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Ci Petero olwongogi oterogi i ot, gubedo welone.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Orwone en oa ci ocito kwedgi, ki utmego mogo ma gibedo i Jopa guceto kacel kwede. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ka orwone mukene gudonyo i Cecaria. Kornelio obedo kakurugi ma olwongo lutugi ki lureme ma gin cokcok kwede ci gucoke bote. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ka Petero oo i dog ot, ci Kornelio oromo kwede, opoto oryebe piny katyene kun wore. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ento Petero oile malo, kun waco ni, “Aa malo icung; an bene adano adana.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Ka oloko kwede ci odonyo i ot, onongo lwak dano gucoke iye. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Petero owaco botgi ni, “Wun wungeyo ni bedo me kwer bot Lujudaya me ribe kwedwu, kadi wa limo larok mo. Ento Lubanga otyeko nyutu bota ni pe alwong dano mo ni dano atata nyo ni me kwer. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ma omiyo ka kilwonga ci abino labongo pyem mo. An dong apenyo ni, wulwonga pingo?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Ci Kornelio ogamo ni, “Tin nino me angwene ikin cawa man, ma onongo atye kalega i oda ikom cawa abongwen, ci nen, laco mo ocung inyima ma oruku bongo maryeny, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />kun waco ni, ‘Kornelio, Legani ki moti me kony oito malo obedo gin me po ikomi inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Ma omiyo in icwal dano i Jopa gupeny pi Cimon ma kilwongo Petero; en tye ogony i ot pa Cimon lanyong pyen i dog nam.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Kitmeno acwalo dano boti cut, ci in bene itimo ber ibino. Kombedi wan ducu watye kany inyim Lubanga pi winyo lok ma Rwot ociki kwede ducu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Petero otito i ot pa Kornelio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nwo 10:17</ref> </char>
    </note> Ci Petero ocako lok kun waco ni, “Adada an dong aniang atir ni Lubanga pe poko kin dano. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ento en jolo dano ma i rok ducu ma gilworo en ki ma gitiyo gin matye atir. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Wun wungeyo lok ma Lubanga ocwalo bot Jo Icrael, kun tito lok me Kwena Maber me kuc ma Yecu Kricito okelo; en aye Rwot pa dano ducu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Lok man yam kitucu oromo lobo Judaya ducu kun ocake ki i Galilaya inge kare ma Jon otito lok ikom batija. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Wungeyo kit ma Lubanga owiro kwede Yecu Lanajaret ki Cwiny Maleng ki teko; dok kit macalo en yam wire kwede kun tiyo gin maber dok cango jo ducu ma Catan yelogi; pien onongo Lubanga tye kwede. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Dok wan lucadene ikom gin ma en otiyo ducu i lobo Judaya ki i Jerucalem. Yam guneke kun kingabe ikom yat. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ento Lubanga ocere woko inino me adeke, ci onyute bot dano; <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />pe bot dano ducu, ento bot wan jo mayam Lubanga oyero pi bedo lucaden. Wan wacamo dok wamato kwede kacel ikare madong ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Dok ocikowa ni watit lok ki dano kun wamiyo caden ni, man aye ngat mayam Lubanga oyero me bedo langolkop pa jo makwo ki pa jo ma oto. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Lunebi ducu gubedo caden ikome ni, dano ducu ma ye en kibiweko balgi woko pi nyinge.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lurok gulimo Cwiny Maleng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Ikare ma Petero pud tye kaloko lok meno, Cwiny Maleng opye ikom jo ducu ma owinyo loke. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Lujudaya ma guye Yecu ma onongo gubino ki Petero guuru mada pien mot me Cwiny Maleng dong kionyo wa ikom Lurok. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Guwinyo ka gin gidumu leb mapatpat kun gipako Lubanga. Ci Petero openyo ni, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Ngat mo tye matwero gengo batija pa jo man ki pii, ma kun dong gulimo Cwiny Maleng macalo wan?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ci ociko ni kibatijagi inying Yecu Kricito. Lacen gin gulege ni obed kwedgi pi kare mo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petero odwoko lok bot jo muye Yecu i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Ikare meno lukwena ki jo ma guye ma gitye i Judaya guwinyo ni Lurok bene dong guye lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ka Petero ocito i Jerucalem, ci dul pa jo ma mito ni jo ma oye Kricito myero kong kilirgi gucako ngono en. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Ci guwaco ni, “Pingo nene icito bot jo ma pe kilirogi ci icamo kwedgi?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ento Petero ogamo lok man, kun tito botgi kore ki kore ni: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Ikare ma abedo i taun madit me Jopa ma abedo kalega, ci aneno gin anyuta. Aneno gin mo ma lor piny macalo cuka madit, kun bino piny matye ki twoke angwen, ci olor wa piny macok kweda inyima. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ka angiyo kome cok, ci aneno iye lee, nguu ki kwayi anyai ducu ki winyo mapatpat. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ci awinyo dwon ma waca ni, <char style="wj">‘Petero, a malo inek wek icam.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ento agamo ni ‘Pe, Rwot, pien peya jami ata ki me kwer odonyo idoga.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ento dwon odok iye ki ipolo ni, <char style="wj">‘Gin ma Lubanga olonyo in pe ilwong ni obedo me kwer.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Man otime tyen adek, ci jami meno kidwoko woko ipolo. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />I cawa meno kikome en aye jo adek ma kicwalogi bota ki i Cecaria guo kwede i ot mayam watye iye. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ci Cwiny Maleng otita ni a i wot kwedgi, ma pe ipoko kin dano. Ci an aa awoto ki utmego man abiceli, ka wadonyo i ot pa dano meno. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Ci en otito botwa kit ma eneno lamalaika ocung kwede i ode kun wace ni, ‘Cwal dano i Jopa wek guom Cimon ma kilwongo ni Petero. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Dano man aye bititi lok ma bilaro in ki jo ma i odi ducu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ikare ma acako lok, ci Cwiny Maleng opye ikomgi kit ma con okwongo pye ikomwani. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Tic 1:5</ref></char></note> Ci apo lok mayam Rwot owaco, ni, <char style="wj">‘Jon yam obatija dano ki pii, ento wun kibibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleng.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Kace Lubanga omiyogi mot marom aroma kit ma omiyowa ikare ma waye iye Rwot Yecu Kricito, ci an anga ma atwero pyem ki Lubanga?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Ka guwinyo lok man, ci guling litik, ka gucako pako Lubanga kun giwaco ni, “Lurok bene Lubanga dong omiyogi ngut me donyo i kwo.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwak jo muye Kricito i Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1">Tic 8:1</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:4">4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 8:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> Jo mayam guket ikare me nek ma ocake ikom Citefano ni guwoto nio wa Poiniki ki Caiprac ki Antiokia, kun pe gitito lok bot ngat mo, kono bot Lujudaya keken. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ento jo mukene ikin gi, jo me Caiprac ki me Cirene, ka guo i Antiokia ci guloko ki Lugrik bene kun gitito pi Rwot Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Teko pa Rwot onongo tye ikomgi, ci lwak jo mapol guloke bot Rwot. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Lok man owinye bot jo muye Kricito ma i Jerucalem, ci gucwalo Barnaba i Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ma en oo kunu, oneno tic me kica pa Lubanga, ci cwinye obedo yom iye. Ci ocuku cwinygi me moko ikom Rwot matek ki cwinygi ducu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnaba onongo dano maber ma opong ki Cwiny Maleng ki niye. En oweko lwak jo mapol guloke bot Rwot.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ci Barnaba ocito Taruco kayenyo Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ikare ma ononge ci okele i Antiokia. Ci gubedo kacel ki jo ma oye Kricito pi mwaka kulu kun gipwonyo lwak jo mapol. Ki i Antiokia aye kikwongo lwongo jo ma oye Kricito ni lukricitayo.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ikare meno lunebi mogo gua ki i Jerucalem gucito i Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ngat acel ki ikin gi ma nyinge Agabo ocung ci otito lok ma Cwiny Maleng onyute lok ma bitime i anyim, ni wang mo kec bipoto i lobo ducu. Man otime ikare pa Kalaudio ma laloc madit. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Pieno lupwonye gumoko ni ngat acel acel omii kony kit ma en twero bot utmego ma gibedo i Judaya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ci gutimo kitmeno, ka gucwalo bot ludongo kun Barnaba ki Caulo aye gitero.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Unu Lukwena omede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ikare meno rwot Kerode oketo aun ikom jo mogo ikin jo ma oye Kricito. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ci oneko Yakobo omin Jon ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Ka dong oneno ni oyomo cwiny Lujudaya, ci omako Petero bene. Man otime ikare me nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi pe Iye. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ka dong omake, ci okete ibuc, ci omiye bot lukur piny matye i dul angwen mapatpat kun dul acel acel tye iye lukur piny angwen angwen wek gukure, kun mito ni gipid lok ikome inge nino madito me Karama me Kato. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Gin gubedo ka kuru Petero i ot buc kitmeno. Ento lwak jo ma oye Kricito gubedo kalego Lubanga pire matek.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilaro Petero ki i buc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />I dyewor ma orune Kerode dong mito kelo Petero wokoni, onongo Petero obutu onino ikin acikari aryo, ma gutweye woko ki nyor aryo, ki lukur piny bene onongo gitye ka kuru dog ot buc. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ci Nen, lamalaika pa Rwot onen, ci dero ocaro i kicika. Ogoyo but Petero ocoye woko, kun waco bote ni, “A malo oyot.” Ci nyor opoto woko ki i cinge. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ci lamalaika owace ni, “Ruk ginarukani, irwak war i tyeni,” ci otimo kitmeno. Dok owace ni, “Dwal kanyini ikomi ci ilub kora.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Ci okato woko, olubu kore. En pe ongeyo ni gin ma lamalaika timo ni tye me ada; ento otamo ni etye ka lek. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Ka dong gukato lukur piny ma okwongo ki me aryone, ci guo i dog ot ma giloro ki nyonyo ma kikato kwede woko i dye gang. Dogola oyabe kene, ci gukato gucito woko, gulubu yoo ka acel, ci lamalaika oweke woko. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ka Petero ocako niang pire kene kun waco ni, “Dong atyeko niang kombedi ni Rwot ocwalo lamalaikane olara woko ki i cing Kerode ki ikom gin ducu ma Lujudaya gigeno ni bitime ikoma ni.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ka dong oniang, ci ocito i ot pa Maliam min Jon ma nyinge mukene Marako, kama jo mapol gugure iye, ma gitye kalega. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ka odwongo dog gang ma i yoo, ci angeca ma nyinge Roda obino ka niang ikome. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ka oniang dwon Petero, ci yomcwiny ogenge yabo doggang woko, ento oringo omwome i ot owaco ni, “Petero tye ocung woko i dog gang.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Gin guwace ni, “In lapoya.” Ento en orido ni tye ada. Gugamo ni, “Meno lamalaikane!” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ento Petero dok omede ki dwongo doggang, ka guyabo, ci guneno en, ci guuru. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ka ojukugi ki cinge ni guling, ci otito botgi kit ma Rwot okwanye kwede ki ibuc, kun waco ni, “Wutit lok man bot Yakobo ki bot utmego.” Ka oa woko ki kenyo, ocito woko kamukene.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ka piny oru, ci piny ocako lyeti woko ki bot acikari, ni Petero man otime ningning. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Ka Kerode oyenye ci pe ononge, ka openyo acikari ma lukur piny, ci ociko ni kinekgi woko. Inge man Kerode oa woko ki i Judaya ocito i Cecaria, obedo kong kunu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Kerode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Kiniga omako Kerode ikom jo Turu ki Cidon; ci gucoke gubino bote ma onongo gimer ki Blacito, ladit maloyo ot pa rwot. Ci gupenyo ni gimito kuc, pien lobogi limo cam ma a ki i lobo pa rwot Kerode. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ikom nino ma kiciko, Kerode oruku iye jor me kere, oito obedo kwede iwi komkere, ka dong ocako lok botgi. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Ci lwak guwoo matek ni, “Man dwon lubanga, pe dwon dano!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Lamalaika pa Lubanga ogoye woko cut, pien pe omiyo deyo bot Lubanga; ci kwidi ocamo kome ci oto woko.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ento lok pa Lubanga onya omede ameda.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Barnaba ki Caulo gudwogo i Jerucalem ma onongo dong gucobo tic ma kiorogi iye, ci gukelo Jon ma nyinge mukene Marako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yero ki oro Barnaba gin ki Caulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ikare meno lwak jo ma oye Yecu matye i Antiokia onongo dong gin tye ki lunebi ki lupwony: Barnaba, Cimeon ma kilwongo Niga, Lukia me Cirene, ki Manaen ma odongo kacel ki Kerode laloyo, ki Caulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ikare ma gitye kamiyo woro bot Rwot ki nirii kec, ci Cwiny Maleng owaco ni, “Wukwanya Barnaba ki Caulo pi tic ma alwongogi pireni.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Lacen ka dong gutyeko lega ki nirii kec, ci guketo cinggi ikomgi ka gucikogi.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwena gutito lok pa Lubanga i Caiprac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ka Cwiny Maleng ocwalo Barnaba ki Caulo, ci gucito i dog nam i Celeukia; ka gua ki kunu gukwang gucito i Caiprac. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Ka guo i Calamic, gutucu iye lok pa Lubanga i kacoke pa Lujudaya. Gin onongo gitye kacel ki Jon Mark ma lakonygi. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ka guwoto gurumu i cula ducu nio wa i Papo, ci gurwate ki laco mo ma obedo latyet, lanebi ma lagoba, Lajudaya, ma nyinge Bar - Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />En obedo kacel ki laloyo, Cergio Paulo, en laco ma laryeko. Laloyo olwongo Barnaba ki Caulo bote kun onongo mito winyo lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ento Elima ma latyet (meno aye telok me nyinge) ocako pyem kwedgi kun mito ngako laloyo woko ki i niye. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ento Caulo ma kilwongo bene ni Paulo, ka en opong ki Cwiny Maleng, ociko wange ikome, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ci owace ni, “In latin pa Larac, in lamerok me kit ducu matye atir, ipong ki lok me bwola, labal wi dano, in pud ibimede ki dwanyo yo pa Rwot ma ocung atiri? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Kombedi teko pa Rwot opoto ikomi; wangi bicor woko, pe ibineno ceng pi kare mo.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:11">Cutcut lupuu ocido wange woko, ci opange kun yenyo dano wek omak bade opeye. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Laloyo oye Yecu ikare ma oneno gin ma otimeni, pien obedo ka uru kit pwony ma kimiyo ikom Rwot.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitito lok i Antiokia me lobo Picidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Lacen Paulo ki luwote gukwang gua ki i Papo, gucito i Perga i lobo Pampulia. Ci Jon owekogi odok woko i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ento gin gua ki i Perga gucito i Antiokia me lobo Picidia, ci gudonyo i kacoke i ceng Cabit, gubedo piny. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ka dong kityeko kwano Cik pa Moses ki lok pa lunebi, ci ludito me kacoke gucwalo lok botgi kun gipenyogi ni, “Utmego, ka wutye ki lok mo me cuko cwiny dano, ci wuwaci.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ka Paulo ocung ci ojukugi ki cinge kun waco ni, “Jo Icrael, ki wun dano ma wulworo Lubanga, wuwiny. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Nia 1:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Nia 12:51</ref></char></note> Lubanga pa rok pa jo Icrael yam oyero kwariwa, ci omiyo dano gunya madwong ikare ma gubedo i Ejipt. En okwanyogi woko ki kunu ki tek mere. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Wel 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Nwo 1:31</ref></char></note> Odiyo cwinye ikomgi i tim pi mwaka pyere angwen. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Nwo 7:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1">Yoc 14:1</ref></char></note> Dong ka otyeko rok abiro ma i lobo Kanaan ni woko, ci omiyogi lobo meno me bedo meggi. Man ducu otime pi mwaka maromo miya angwen ki pyere abic. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Lung 2:16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Cam 3:20</ref></char></note> Lacen omiyogi lungolkop nio kwede wa ikom Camuel ma lanebi. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Cam 8:5</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:21-25">1 Cam 10:21-25</ref></char></note> Lacen ka gupenyo pi rwot; ci Lubanga omiyo botgi Caulo wod pa Kic, laco ma a ki i kaka pa Benjamin, pi mwaka pyere angwen. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Cam 13:14</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:12">1 Cam 16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Jab 89:20</ref></char></note> Ka dong okwanye woko, ci oyero Daudi, oketo me bedo rwotgi. Otito pi Daudi kun waco ni, ‘Atyeko nongo Daudi wod pa Yece; en laco ma yomo cwinya, ma bitiyo gin ma amito ducu.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Lubanga okelo Lalar bot Jo Icrael ki ikin likwayo pa laco meno, macalo yam, ociko, en aye Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3:3</ref></char></note> Ikare ma peya obino, Jon otito lok bot Jo Icrael ducu ni gin onguti ikom balgi wek kibaticagi. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jon 1:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20-27">Jon 1:20-27</ref></char></note> Ikare ma Jon dong cok cobo dog tice en owaco ni, ‘Wun wutamo ni an anga? An pe angat ma wukuruni; ento dano ma bibino ma lubu kora, an pe amyero me gonyo war tyene.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Utmego, wun likwayo ma i kaka pa Abraim, ki jo mukene ma ikinwu ma gilworo Lubanga, wan aye kicwalo botwa lok man me lare. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ento jo mayam gibedo i Jerucalem, ki luditogi, onongo pe giniang ikome, pe bene guniang lok mayam lunebi gutito ki ma kikwano nino ducu i ceng Cabit. Ci gucobo lok pa lunebi kun gungolo lok me to iwi Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat 27:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13">Mar 15:13</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Jon 19:15</ref></char></note> Kadi pe gunongo bal mo ikome, gin gungole to, ci gulego Pilato wek oye kineke. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jon 19:38-42</ref></char></note> Ka dong gutyeko cobo lok mayam kicoyo ikome ducu, ci gukwanye woko ki ikom yat, gupyelo kome i lyel. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ento Lubanga ocere woko ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Tic 1:3</ref></char></note> Dok obedo ka nen pi nino mapol bot jo mayam gua kwede ki i Galilaya gubino kwede i Jerucalem, ma koni gin aye cadene bot lwak. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Wan bene wakelo botwu lok me Kwena Maber ni, gin mayam Lubanga ociko pire bot kwariwa, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Jab 2:7</ref></char></note> en ocobo bot wan likwayogi pi cero Yecu, macalo yam kicoyo bene i jabuli me aryo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘In i Woda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">tin dong anywali.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Ica 55:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lok ikom cero en ki ikin jo ma oto, ma pe kome dok bitop woko, yam oloko kit man ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Abimini gicike maleng ki ma gene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">mayam aciko pi Daudi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Jab 16:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Dok owaco bene i jabuli mukene ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Pe ibiweko kom danoni ma geni top woko.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Pien ka Daudi yam otyeko tic kun cobo yub pa Lubanga, en oto, ci kiyiko en kanget kwarine, kome otop woko. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ento ngat ma Lubanga ocero woko ni kome pe otop. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Utmego, myero wunge ni, pi dano man en aye Lubanga oweko ki tucu kwena me weko bal bot wun ducu; <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />ci omiyo ngat acel acel ma ye en ki kwanyo bale woko ducu ma pe kitwero kwanyo ki ikomwu ite Cik pa Moses. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ber dong wugwoke, wek gin mayam lunebi guloko pire ni pe opot ikomwu:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Kab 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> ‘Nen ba, wun lucac! Wuur matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ci wuto woko matwal!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Pien atye katiyo tic mo ikarewu ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ma pe wun wubiye kadi matidi mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">kadi ngat mo otucu pire botwu.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ikare ma gukato woko, lwak gulego ni lok man myero kitit botgi odoco i ceng Cabit mabino ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ka lwak ma gubedo i kacoke dong guket woko, ci Lujudaya mapol ki jo ma guloke i dini pa Lujudaya ma giworo Lubanga gulubu kor Paulo ki Barnaba, ci gin gubedo kalok kwedgi kun gicuku cwinygi ni myero gumede ki geno kica pa Lubanga.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />I Cabit ma olubu pol dano ma i gang meno gucore gugure kacel pi winyo lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ento ka Lujudaya guneno lwak, ci nyeko omakogi, gucako pyem ki lok ma Paulo tito, ci guyete bene. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Paulo ki Barnaba guloko ki tekcwiny labongo lworo, kun giwaco ni, “Onongo myero kong kikwong tito lok pa Lubanga botwu. Ento macalo dong wucwalo woko cen ni, dong wungolo giwu kenwu ni pe omyero pi nongo kwo ma pe tum. Dong wunen, waloke giwa bot Lurok. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Ica 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note> Pien Rwot yam ocikowa kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Aketo in me bedo dero bot Lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">wek imii lare oo bot jo me wi lobo ducu.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ka Lurok guwinyo lok man, ci cwinygi obedo yom, gucako pilo wilok pa Lubanga; ci jo ducu ma myero gunong kwo ma pe tum guye Yecu.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Lok ikom Rwot omede oromo lobo meno ducu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ento Lujudaya gurubu i mon ma giworo Lubanga ma gitye i rwom me dito mamalo, kacel ki ludito me taun madit meno ma giloyo dano, ci gubalo cwinygi woko; gucako yelo Paulo ki Barnaba ka guryemogi woko ki i lobogi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref></char></note> Ento gutengo apwa tyen gi wek obed caden ikomgi, ka gucito i Ikonio. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Lupwonye cwinygi obedo yom dok gupong ki Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulo gucito Ikonio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ikare ma Paulo ki Barnaba dong gitye i Ikonio, gudonyo i kacoke pa Lujudaya macalo kitgi tye. Dong pi kit ma guloko kwede omiyo lwak jo mapol ikin, Lujudaya ki Lurok guye Rwot. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ento Lujudaya ma pe guye gutugu Lurok ma omiyo cwinygi odoko kec ikom jo ma oye Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Paulo ki Barnaba gubedo kunu pi kare malac kun giloko pi Rwot ki tekcwiny labongo lworo, Rwot bene omiyogi twero me tiyo lanyut ki tango mapol ma omoko kwede lok ma gitito ikom kicane. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ento jo Ikonio igi opoke woko; dul mogo gudok kom Lujudaya, ki dul mogo ikom lukwena. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Ka Lurok ki Lujudaya guribe kacel ki lulocgi pi bino katimogi marac ki celogi ki got. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ka gugwilo loke ci gupuce woko wa i Licitra ki Derube, taun madito ma i lobo Likaonia, ki i lobo ma orumu kenyo; <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Gin gubedo katucu lok me Kwena Maber kunu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ki Barnaba i Licitra ki Derube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />I Licitra onongo tye iye laco mo ma onongo laput nia ikare ma kinywale pe omedo ki woto ki tyene. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />En obedo kawinyo ka Paulo loko, ci Paulo ociko wange onene, ci oniang ni en tye ki niye ma oromo ma weko en cang. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ci Paulo owace matek ni, “Aa malo, icung ki tyeni atir.” Ci olenge malo opye, ocako wot. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ka lwak guneno gin ma Paulo otiyo, ci gudange matek i leb Likaonia kun gin waco ni, “Lubanga gulor piny botwa macalo dano!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Gulwongo Barnaba ni Jeuc<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14:12 </char> <char style="fk">Jeuc </char> obedo jok madit pa jo Grik ikare macon. Ermec obedo jok matidi ma Jeuc oro. </note> ki Paulo ni Ermec, pien en aye lalok makato. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ajwaka pa Jeuc matye ki ot woro jokgi inge taun kacel ki lwak gukelo twon ma kideyo ki ature i dogcel me taun kun gimito tyero gitum bot lukwena. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ento ka lukwena Barnaba ki Paulo guwinyo pire, ci guyeco bongigi kun kibaro dye lwak ki dange ni, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 146:6">Jab 146:6</ref></char></note> “Wun wutimo kit man pingo? Wan bene wa dano, ma kitwa rom ki mewu. Wakelo botwu lok me Kwena Maber, wek wun wua woko ki bot gin ma konye peke, wuloke bot Lubanga makwo mayam ocweyo polo ki lobo ki nam ki gigu ducu matye. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Yam ikare macon en oye ni rok ducu gulub yogi ken gi. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kadi bed kitmeno, kare ducu en bedo ki cadene ma nyutu ni en tye. En otimowu ber kun cwalo botwu kot ma ocwer ki ipolo, dok miyowu kit cam mapatpat ma cek ka karegi oromo mamiyo wuyeng ki cam, cwinywu bene bedo yom.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kadi bed guloko lok meno, juku lwak wek pe gutyer gitum botgi obedo tek tutwal.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ento Lujudaya mogo gucito kunu ma gua ki i Antiokia ki i Ikonio. Gupiyo lwak, ka gucelo Paulo ki got ci guywayo woko gutere inge taun madit meno, kun gitamo ni dong oto woko. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ento ka lupwonye gucoke bote, ci oa malo odonyo i taun madit meno. Orwone guwoto gin ki Barnaba wa i Derube.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dok cen i Antiokia ma i lobo Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ka Paulo ki Barnaba dong gutucu lok me Kwena Maber i taun madit meno, ki nongo lwak lupwonye mapol, ci gudok cen i Licitra ki Ikonio ki Antiokia ma i lobo Picidia. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Kunu gujingo cwiny lupwonye, ki cuko cwinygi ni gumede i niye, ma giwaco ni, “Omyero wadony i can madwong ka wakat kwede i ker pa Lubanga.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />I kabedo acel acel ma jo ma guye Kricito tye iye, guketo ludongo makakagi ki lega ki rii kec, ci gumiyogi i cing Rwot mayam gin guyeni.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ka guwoto gukato ki i Picidia, ci gubino wa i lobo Pampulia. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Ka gutyeko tito lok pa Lubanga i Perga ci gucito piny i Atalia. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ka gua ki kunu gukwang nio i Antiokia, kama yam kimiyogi iye i cing Lubanga wek en okonygi ki kicane ikom tic madong gutyeko coboneni.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ka guo i Antiokia, gucoko lwak ma oye Yecu kacel, ci gutito botgi gin ducu madong Lubanga otyeko tiyo kacel kwedgi, ki kit ma oyabo kwede dogola me niye bot Lurok. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ci gubedo kunu ki lupwonye pi kare malac.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Coke madit i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ento jo mogo gubino ki i Judaya ma gupwonyo utmego ni, “Ka pe kilirowu macalo Cik pa Moses tye, pe wutwero lare.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Ma omiyo Paulo ki Barnaba gubedo ka laro lok ki pyem kwedgi matek. Ci ki yero Paulo ki Barnaba ki jo mukene, kicwalogi Jerucalem bot lukwena ki ludongo pi lok man. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Kitmeno ka lwak ma oye Yecu gutyeko lwokogi ci guwok ki i Poiniki ki lobo Camaria kun gitito kit ma Lurok guloke kwede bot Kricito ci gukelo yomcwiny madwong bot utmego ducu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ma guo i Jerucalem, lwak ma oye Kricito, kacel ki lukwena ki ludongo, gujologi maber, ci gutito gin ducu ma Lubanga obedo katiyone kwedgi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Ento jo mogo ma guye ma gitye i dul pa Luparicayo gua malo bene kun giwaco ni, “Myero kong kilirgi, ki cikogi ni gumak Cik pa Moses.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Lukwena ki ludongo gucoke kacel ka laro lok man. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Tic 10:1-43</ref></char></note> Ka pyem dong obedo dwong, ci Petero oa malo owaco botgi ni, “Utmego, wun wungeyo ni yam con Lubanga oyero an ki ikinwu ni Lurok guwinyo lok me Kwena Maber ki idoga ka guye. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Dok Lubanga ma ngeyo cwiny dano ducu obedo cadengi pi miyogi Cwiny Maleng macalo yam omiyo botwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />En pe oketo apokapoka ikinwa ki gin, ento olonyo cwinygi pi niye. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Pingo wun wutemo i Lubanga ma wumito riyo okol mapek i ngut lupwonye ma tingone oloyo kwariwa kadi wa wan bene? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ento wan waye ni wabilare pi kica pa Rwotwa Yecu, ki gin bene kitmeno.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ka dong jo mucoke ducu guling mot, kun giwinyo kit ma Barnaba ki Paulo gitito kit lanyut ki tango ma Lubanga obedo katiyogi kun wok ki botgi ikin Lurok. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ma dong gutyeko lokgi, ci Yakobo ogamo ni, “Utmego, wuwinya. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Cimeon dong otito kit ma Lubanga okwongo nyutu kwede ni eparo pi Lurok kun okwanyo ki ikin gi lwak ma kilwongo ki nyinge. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Man rwate ki lok mayam lunebi guwaco, macalo kicoyo ni,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 9:11">Amo 9:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 9:12">12</ref></char>
    </note> ‘I nge meno abidwogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">ci abigero aduc pa Daudi mayam opoto pinyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">abigero odoco kama yam obale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">abiroco odoco amiyo cung maber,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />wek jo mudonge guyeny Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">kacel ki Lurok ducu ma kilwongogi ki nyinga.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Meno Rwot aye ma owaco ma omiyo lok meno ongene nia wa con.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ma omiyo an angolo ni, pe myero wayelu Lurok ma guloke bot Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Nia 34:15-17</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">Lev 18:6-23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lev 17:10-16</ref></char></note> Ento myero wacoyu waraga botgi ni pe gucam gin mo ma kityero inyim jogi, pien odoko gin me kwer, pe gutim tim tarwang, pe gucam ringo lee ma kideyo adeya, pe gucam remo. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Pien cake ikare macon Moses tye ki jo ma gitito loke i taun madito ducu, kun gikwano cike i kacoke i ceng Cabit ducu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waraga bot Lurok ma guye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ka dong lukwena ki ludongo, kacel ki lwak ma oye Kricito ducu, gutamo ni ber kiyer dano ki ikin gi, kicwalgi i Antiokia kacel ki Paulo ki Barnaba. Ci gucwalo Juda ma kilwongo Barcaba, ki Cira, gin aye jo ma gidito ikin utmego. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Gumiyo botgi waraga ma kwane kit man ni, “Bot utmego ma Lurok ma i Antiokia ki Ciria ki Cilicia. Wan utmegiwu ma lukwena ki ludongo wamotowu mada. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Wawinyo ni dano mogo ma gua ki botwa gubedo ka yelowu ki lok mapol, ki rubu tamwu woko, kadi bed wan pe wacikogi ki kit lok macalo meno. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Pimeno wan ka wacoke waneno ni ber wayer dano wacwalgi botwu kacel ki Barnaba ki Paulo, ma wamarogi tutwal. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Gin jo madong gudyero kwogi pi Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ma omiyo wacwalo botwu Juda ki Cira, gin bene ki komgi gibititowu lok ki dogi marom ki man ma wacoyo ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Cwiny Maleng oneno ni ber, kacel ki wan bene, ni pe waket yec mapek tutwal ikomwu makato lok magi ma pirgi tego: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />pe wucam gin ma kityero bot jogi, pe wucam remo ki ringo lee ma kideyo adeya, pe wutim tim mo me tarwang. Ka wugwoke ikom meno ducu, ci wubitimo ber. Dong wubed maber.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kitmeno ka kicwalogi, ci gin gucito i Antiokia; ka dong gucoko lwak kacel, ka kimiyogi waraga. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ka dong gutyeko kwano, ci cwinygi obedo yom ikom lok ma kicoyo iye me cuko cwinygi. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Juda kacel ki Cira, ma gin bene lutit lok pa Lubanga, gucuku cwiny utmego ki lwak lok mapol ma omiyogi teko. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ka dong gutyeko nino mapolpol kunu, ci gulwokogi ki kuc ka gidok bot utmego mayam gucwalogi ni. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ento Cira otamo ni ber edong kunu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baibul mukene weko tyeng man woko.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ento Paulo ki Barnaba gudong i Antiokia, kun gipwonyo dano ki tito lok pa Rwot, kacel ki jo mukene mapol bene.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ki Barnaba Gupoke woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />I nge kare manok Paulo owaco ki Barnaba ni, “Bin wek wadok ka limo utmego ma i taun ducu mayam watucu iye lok pa Rwot, wanen kit ma gitye kwede.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Ci Barnaba onongo mito ni giwot ki Jon ma nyinge mukene Marako. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Tic 13:13</ref></char></note> Ento Paulo otamo ni pe dok ber me tero dano mayam oa owekogi i Pampulia, pe owoto kwedgi i dog tic. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ci gubedo ka laro lok magwa, nio ka kin gi opoke woko. Barnaba owoto ki Marako ci gukwango nam gucito i Caiprac, <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />ento Paulo oyero Cira ci gua madong utmego omiyogi i cing Rwot wek okonygi ki kicane. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ci Paulo owoto obaro i Ciria ki Cilicia kun miyo tekcwiny bot lwak ma oye Kricito.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Temceo onywako wot ki Paulo ki Cira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo oo wa i Derube ki Licitra. Lapwonye mo onongo tye kunu ma nyinge Temceo, wod pa dako mo ma Lajudaya ma oye Kricito, ento wone aye Lagrik. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Utmego ma i Licitra ki Ikonio giloko ki nying Temceo maber. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo onongo mito wot kwede; ci otere, olire, pi Lujudaya ma gitye kunu, pien gin ducu onongo gingeyo ni wone Lagrik. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ikom wotgi ducu ma giwoto iye i taun mapatpat gubedo kamiyo bot dano ma guye Kricito cik me aluba mayam lukwena ki ludongo gumoko ki Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Kitmeno lwak ma oye Kricito i kabedo acel acel gumoko matek i niye, gubedo ka mede mapol nino ducu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gin ma Paulo oneno i Teroa i gin anyuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ka guwoto gubaro i lobo Perugia ki Galatia, ci Cwiny Maleng ogengogi ni pe gulok lok pa Lubanga i Acia. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ka guo ma gukemo Micia, ci gutemo dok tung Bitinia, ento Cwiny pa Yecu pe oye ki gin. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ma omiyo gukato ki i Micia, gucito piny i Teroa. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Paulo oneno gin anyuta idyewor meno, kun laco mo me Makedonia ocung inyime, obako doge bote kun waco ni, “Kwang nam ibin i Makedonia ikonywa.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ka otyeko neno man i gin anyuta, ci wayube oyotoyot me cito i Makedonia, kun watamo ni Lubanga aye olwongowa pi tito lok me Kwena Maber bot jo ma kunu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ludiya oloke bot Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Wacako kwango nam ki i Teroa, wakwang atir nio wa i Camotrake, ci orwone wao i Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ki kunu wacito i Pilipi taun madit maloyo pa Jo Roma i lobo Makedonia. Ci wabedo i taun madit meno pi kare manok. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />I ceng Cabit wacito woko inge taun madit meno i kabedo mo ma i dog kulu, ma watamo ni gwok nyo kalega tye kunu; ci wabedo piny kalok ki mon ma gugure. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ngat acel ma obedo kawinyo lokwa en aye dako ma nyinge Ludiya ma oa ki i taun madit ma kilwongo Tuatira. En lacat bongo ma lamar lamar, dano ma woro Lubanga. Rwot oyabo tame omiyo oketo cwinye kawinyo lok ma Paulo waco. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ka dong kibatija en kacel ki jo ma i ode, en obako doge botwa kun waco ni, “Ka wuneno ni an lagen bot Rwot, ci wubin wubed i oda,” nio ka en oridowa, wadoko welone.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitweyo Paulo gi i buc i Pilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ikare ca ka ceng watye kacito i kabedo me lega, ci warwate ki nyako mo ma angeca matyeto tyet ki jok matye ikome, kun kelo lwak lim mapol bot luditone pi lok ma en tyeto. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />En obedo kalubu korwa, kun dange ni, “Jo man gin aye lutic pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal ma gitucu botwu yo me lare.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />En obedo katimo kitmeno nino mapol. Ento kiniga omako Paulo, ci oloke owaco ki jok ni, “Aciko in inying Yecu Kricito, a woko ki ikome.” Ci jok oa woko ki ikome i cawa meno cut.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ento ka luditone guneno ni gen me nongo lim dong oa woko, gumako Paulo ki Cira guywayogi guterogi wa i cuk inyim luloc. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Ka guketogi inyim lungolkop, ci guwaco ni, “Jo man gin Lujudaya, ma gin tye ka rubu taun wa maditi woko. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Gin gipwonyo kit mogo ma cikwa pe ye ni wagam nyo walubgi, pien wan Luroma.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ci lwak guribe kalweny ikomgi; lungolkop bene guyeco ginarukagi ki ikomgi ci lungolkop guciko ni kipwodgi ki odo. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ka kityeko pwodogi matek, ci gucwalogi ibuc, kun kiciko lalo mabuc ni ogwokgi maber. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Ka dong owinyo cik ma kitmeno, oketogi i kicika ma i tyelo, oroyo okol i tyen gi.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ento i cwiny dyewor Paulo ki Cira gubedo kalega ki kawero wer bot Lubanga ma lumabuc mukene bene giwinyogi. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ci lobo ocako yenge matek, guti me ot buc oyenge, ci dogola ducu guyabe woko cut, ki nyor pa ngat acel acel ogony woko. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Ka lalo mabuc oco ci onongo ni dog ot buc oyabe woko tye twolo, owoto pala lucwane kun mito neke kekene, pien otamo ni lumabuc gulwi woko. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ento Paulo odange ki dwone matek ni, “Pe itime kekeni marac, wan ducu watye kany.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Lalo ot mabuc ociko ni kikel mac, ci odonyo i tyelo oyot kun kome myel ki lworo, oryebe piny inyim Paulo ki Cira. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ka en okelogi woko ci owacigi ni, “Luditona, myero atim ango wek alare?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Guwaco bote ni, “Ye Rwot Yecu, ci ibilare, in ki jo ma i odi ducu.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ci guloko lok pa Rwot bote ki bot jo ducu ma i ode. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />I dyewor i cawa meno kikome oterogi olwoko wang retgi, ci kibatija en cut ki jo me ode ducu. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ka oterogi i ode, omiyogi cam; cwinye obedo yom ki jo me ode ducu, pien dong otyeko ye Lubanga.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ka piny dong oru, lungolkop gucwalo acikari ka waco ni, “Wek jo meno dong guciti.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ci lalo mabuc otito ki Paulo ni, “Lungolkop gucwalo lok ni myero wuciti. Wukat woko kombedi wuwot ki kuc.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ento Paulo owaco botgi ni, “Kityeko goyowa inyim lwak, ma peya kingoliwa kop, ma kun wan Luroma, dong kitweyowa ibuc, ka kombedi dok kigonyowa i mung? Pe, wek gin aye gubin gugonywa pirgi ken gi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Ci acikari gutito lok man bot lungolkop, ci gubedo ki lworo ka guwinyo ni gin Luroma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ka dong gubino gubako dogi botgi, ka gukwanyogi woko, gucikogi ni gua woko ki i taun madit meno. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Ka gukato woko ki ibuc, gucito i ot pa Ludiya; ka dong gutyeko neno utmego, ci gucuku cwinygi, ka dong gucito.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Woo ma obedo i Tecalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ka Paulo ki Cira guwok ki i Ampipoli ki Apolonia, ci guo i Tecalonika, kama kacoke pa Lujudaya onongo tye iye. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Paulo obedo ka donyo ikacoke macalo kite tye, ci orii kunu pi cabit adek kun obedo ka laro lok ikom ginacoya kwedgi iceng Cabit adek meno ducu. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Paulo obedo katito lok kore ki kore ma moko ni Kricito myero onen can ki bene ocer woko ki ikin jo ma oto. En owaco ni, “Yecu man ma atito pire botwu ni en aye Kricito ma Lubanga oyero.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ci jo mukene ikin gi lok ocobo cwinygi, guribe ikom Paulo ki Cira, ki lwak jo Grik mapol ma giworo Lubanga, kacel ki mon ma lutela mapol. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ento Lujudaya nyeko omakogi, gukelo jo ma tubu kin dano atata, ci gucoko dano mekelo wo matek i taun madit meno, ci gurumu ot pa Yacon kun giyenyo Paulo ki Cira pi kelogi woko bot lwak ki tek. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ka nongo Paulo ki Cira oloyogi, ci guywayo Yacon ki utmego mogo guterogi inyim luloc me taun madit meno kun gidange ni, “Jo man gitito gin mapat, gitye kaloko tam pa dano me lobo woko, gubino kwede wa kany. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yacon aye ojologi; gin gitye ka balo cik pa Cecar ma giwaco ni tye rwot mukene, ma nyinge Yecu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ka lwak dano ki luloc me taun madit meno guwinyo lok man, ci gucako tuge. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Luloc gumiyo Yacon ki utmego mukene gujengo lim, ka lacen guwekogi gucito.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwena gucito Berea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Utmego gucwalo Paulo ki Cira gucito woko i dyewor meno wa i Berea cut; ka guo ci gucito i kacoke pa Lujudaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Lujudaya ma Berea onongo yam gin jo ma kitgi beco makato jo ma i Tecalonika. Gujolo lok ma kitito botgi ki cwinygi ducu kun gingiyo ginacoya mayam kicoyo nino ducu pi neno kalok ducu ma Paulo titoni tye lok ada. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ma omiyo lwak jo mapol guye Yecu, ki lwak mon madito ma Lugrik ki co mapol. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ento ka Lujudaya ma i Tecalonika guwinyo ni Paulo ki Cira gitye katucu lok pa Lubanga i Berea bene, gin bene gubino kunu, gurubu dano dok gutugu lwak. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Utmego gucwalo Paulo woko oyot i yoo macito i dog nam, ento Cira ki Temceo gudong. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Jo ma gulwoko Paulo ni gutere wa i Atene; ci Paulo ocikogi pi Cira ki Temceo ni gulub kore oyotoyot, ka dong gua, gudok i Berea.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo i Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ikare ma Paulo tye ka kuru Cira ki Temceo i Atene, en oneno taun madit meno opong ki cal jogi, ci olyeto cwinye mada. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Obedo ka laro lok ki Lujudaya ki jo ma giworo Lubanga i kacokegi, ki i cuk bene ki jo ma en rwate kwedgi jwijwi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Luryeko mogo me dul pa Luepikurea ki Lucitoiki <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17:18 </char> <char style="fk">Luepikurea ki Lucitoiki </char> gubedo jo ma gicwako kit pwony mapatpat ikare macon. </note> bene gurwate kwede. Jo mukene guwaco ni, “Lalok atata ni mito tito lok ikom gin ango?” Jo mukene guwaco ni, “En nen calo tito lok ikom jogi mogo ma welo,” pien onongo en tye katito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Yecu ki ikom cer ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Pimeno gumake ci gutere inyim kacoke mayam rwate iwi got ma kilwongo Areopago, kun giwaco ni, “Wamito ngeyo kit pwony manyen ma ikelo ni, <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />pien in dok ikelo lok ma welo tutwal i itwa, ci wamito niang tere.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Ikare meno lwak jo Atene ducu ki welo ma gibedo kunu gityeko karegi ducu katito lok ki winyo lok ikom gin manyen.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ka Paulo ocung i dye kacoke me Areopago, ci owaco ni, “Wun jo Atene, aniang atir ni ikit ducu wun ludini mada. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Pien ikare ma awoto i dye taunwu madit aneno keno tyer mo ma kicoyo ikome ni, ‘Pa lubanga ma pe ngene.’ Gin ma wuworo ma pe wungeyo, man aye a tye katucu botwuni. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Luk 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Ica 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Tic 7:48</ref></char></note> Lubanga mayam ocweyo lobo ki jami ducu matye iye ni, en aye Rwot me polo ki lobo, pe bedo i ot abila ma dano gutiyo ki cinggi. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />En bene pe mito ni dano guwore ki gin ma gutiyo atiya ki cinggi, macalo gin mo orem bote, pien en kikome aye miyo kwo ki dano ducu wa ki yweyo ki jami ducu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />En yam ocweyo rok ducu nia ki ikom dano acel wek gubed iwi lobo ma onongo en omoko kare kikome kama myero gubed iye, ki wang apoki lobo me kabedogi. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />En otumu wek gubed kayenyo Lubanga, wek ka gibongo abonga gwok nyo gugud kome ci ginonge, pien en pe tye cen kamabor ki bot ngat acel acel ikinwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Macalo ngat acel yam ocoyo ni, ‘Wakwo i en, wawoto i en, wabedo i en.’ Ngat acel ikin lucocwu bene ocoyo ni, ‘Wan bene wan lutinone.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Kitmeno ka wan lutino pa Lubanga, pe myero watamu ni Lubanga cal ki cal mo me jabu nyo ryal nyo got ma kipayo ki diro ki tam pa dano. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ikare me kwiya piny Lubanga yam pe oparo pire, ento ikare man en dong ociko ni dano ducu myero gungut ikom balgi. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Pien Lubanga dong otyeko moko nino ma en bingolo iye kop ikom dano ducu ma i lobo ikit ma atir, kun dong oyero ngat ma myero ongol kop ma kakare. Lubanga omiyo bene lanen ma nyutu ni man bitime pi cero dano meno ki ikin jo ma oto.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ka guwinyo Paulo kaloko lok ikom cer ki ikin jo ma oto, jo mogo gucako caye ki jo mukene guwaco ni, “Wamito imed tito lok man botwa kare mukene.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ci Paulo okato woko ki ikacoke. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Jo mukene ma guye loke guribe kwede. Ikin gi onongo tye Dionecio ma dano me Areopago, ki dako mo ma nyinge Damali, ki jo mukene bene.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo i Korint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Lacen ki inge man, Paulo oa ki i Atene ci ocito Korint. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kunu en onongo Lajudaya mo ma nyinge Akwila ma kinywalo i Ponto, ma pud obino kenyo abina nia ki i Itali kacel ki dakone Pricikila, pien laloc madit Kalaudio onongo ociko ni Lujudaya ducu omyero gua woko ki i Roma. Paulo ocito ka limogi ci obedo botgi, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />pien gin ducu onongo gitiyo kit tic acel, en aye tic me yubu kema. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />En obedo ka laro lok i kacoke i nino me Cabit ducu, kun temo loko tam pa Lujudaya ki jo Grik.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ka Cira ki Temceo gua ki i Makedonia, gunongo Paulo onongo ogeto katito lok kun tito bot Lujudaya ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyeroni aye Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ka gilulo ikome, giyete, ci en otengo ginarukane kun waco botgi ni, “Remowu obed iwiwu! An iya gira leng. Cake tin abicito bot Lurok.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ci en oa ki kunu ocito i ot pa laco mo ma nyinge Titio Yucito, obedo larok ma wor Lubanga ode onongo tye cok ki kacoke pa Lujudaya. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kuricipo, ladit me kacoke, oye Rwot ki jo ma i ode ducu; ki lwak jo mapol ma i Korint ma guwinyo lok pa Paulo guye bene, ci kibatijagi. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Rwot onen bot Paulo i gin anyuta idyewor ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Pe ibed ki lworo, ento bed kalok, pe iling,</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" /><char style="wj">pien an atye kwedi, pe tye ngat mo ma bikelo ayela ikomi ki timi marac, pien atye ki lwak jo mapol i taun madit man.”</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Ci obedo kunu mwaka acel ki dwe abicel kun pwonyo lok pa Lubanga ikin gi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ento ikare ma Gallio aye obedo laloyo me lobo Akaya, ci Lujudaya gucoke gutube ikom Paulo, gukele wa inyim kom me ngolo kop. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Ci gin waco ni, “Laco man tye ka bito dano ni guwor Lubanga i yo ma pe lubu cik.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Ento ikare ma Paulo mito ngamo doge kalok, Gallio owaco ki Lujudaya ni, “Ka onongo lok man ocung ikom tim mo marac, nyo kom bal mo marac, kono onongo awiny kokowu, wun Lujudaya. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ento kit macalo obedo pyem ikom lok mogo nyo nying mogo ma dok ikom cik ma mewuni, wun aye wunen giwu kite; an akwero bedo langolkop i lok macalo meno.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ci oryemogi woko ki inyim kom me ngolo kop. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ci cutcut gin ducu gumako Cocitene, ladit me kacoke, ci gugoye inyim kom me ngolo kop. Ento Gallio pe oketo iye cwinye.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo odok cen i Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Wel 6:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Lacen ka man otum, Paulo dok obedo odike ikin luye me Korint pi kare malac, ka oa ki kunu oweko utmego ci en okwango nam ocito i lobo Ciria ma kun Pricikila ki Akwila gunywako yoo kwede. Ci Paulo olyelo wiye i Cenkeria, pien onongo en okwongo kwong.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Man tye ite kwaro pa jo Judaya ma nyutu ni ngat moni ogwoko kwonge</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ka gucito i Epeco, ci oweko Pricikila ki Akwila kunu; ento en ocito i kacoke, olaro lok ki Lujudaya. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ka gulege ni kong obed kunu pi kare malac, ci en okwero woko. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Ento ikare ma en tye ka a ki botgi, ocikogi kun waco botgi ni, “Abidwogo botwu ka Lubanga biye,” ci en ocako kwang nia ki i Epeco.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ka dong otyeko o i Cecaria, ci omede ki wote ocito wa i Jerucalem ka moto jo ma oye Kricito, ka dong olor piny ocito wa i Antiokia. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Paulo odike kong kunu, ka lacen dok oa olimo kabedo ducu ma i lobo Galatia ki Perugia kun jingo cwiny luye ducu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolo otito lok i Epeco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Lajudaya mo ma nyinge Apolo ma kinywalo i Alekijanderia yam obino i Epeco. En laco ma ngeyo lok maber tutwal, dok tye kingec matut i ginacoya. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Onongo yam kipwonye i Yo pa Rwot, dok loko ki miti ma i cwinye ducu, ma pwonyo lok ikom Yecu atir dok kikore, kadi bedi onongo ngeyo lok me batija pa Jon keken. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />En yam oloko ki tekcwiny labongo lworo i kacoke, ento ka Pricikila ki Akwila guwinyo loke, ci gutere gumiye pwony matut ikom Lubanga ma niange makato. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ikare ma Apolo mito kwang cito i Akaya, utmego gujingo cwinye, ka gucoyo waraga bot lupwonye wek gujole. Ka en oo kunu, ci okonyo jo mayam gulimo gum me niye mada. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Pien en oloyo tam pa Lujudaya atyer inyim lwak kun nyutu ki i ginacoya ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyero aye Yecu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo i Epeco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ikare ma Apolo tye i Korint, Paulo owoto ongolo dye lobonu ari ci oo wa i Epeco. En onongo lupwonye mogo kunu, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />ci openyogi ni, “Wun yam wulimo Cwiny Maleng ikare ma wuye Kricito?” Gugamo ni, “Pe, wan peya wawinyo ni Cwiny Maleng bene tye.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ci Paulo owaco botgi ni, “Con kibatijawu ki kit batija ango?” Gugamo ni, “Ki batija pa Jon.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26">Jon 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note> Paulo ogamo ni, “Jon yam obatija dano pi ngut ikom balgi, kun tito bot jo Icrael ni guye ngat ma bibino lubu koreni, ma en aye Yecu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ka guwinyo lok man, ci kibatijagi inying Rwot Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ka Paulo oketo cinge iwigi, ci Cwiny Maleng obino ikomgi; gin gucako dumu leb mapatpat kun gitito lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Gin ducu welgi nongo romo ka apar wiye aryo.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulo obedo ka odonyo i kacoke pa Lujudaya kun loko botgi ki tekcwiny labongo lworo pi dwe adek, dok laro lok ki bako doge pi lok ma mako ker pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ento jo mogo ma pe guye ma guding gucako loko lok marac ikom Yo meno inyim lwak, ci Paulo opoke woko kwedgi, kun woto kacel ki jo ma guye. Paulo obedo kalaro lok nino ducu i ot pwonye pa Tirano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paulo ocako laro lok kunu cake cawa abic me odiko nio wa cawa apar me otyeno. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Man omede otyeko mwaka aryo, ma omiyo jo ma gibedo i Acia guwinyo lok pa Rwot, Lujudaya ki Lugrik ducu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobe pa Cekewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ci Lubanga obedo katiyo tango madongo ki i cing Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Kadi wa latambarane nyo bongine me tic yam kikwanyo woko ki bote ka kitero bot lutwo, ci two cang woko, ki cen bene a woko ki ikom dano. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Lujudaya mogo ma woto ikin piny, ma gin luryem cen, gucako tucu nying Rwot Yecu inyim jo ma cen omakogi kun gin waco ni, “Akwongowu ki nying Yecu ma Paulo tito pireni.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Yam tye Lajudaya mo ma obedo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ma nyinge Cekewa, ma awobene abiro gubedo katimo kitmeno. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ento cen odok iye botgi ni, “Yecu angeyo, ki Paulo bene angeyo; ento wun kono angagi?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ci laco ma cen omakoni okato ikomgi ci obwoyogi woko ducu. Oryemogi, ci gumwome woko ki i ot kun gitye munero ki ret ikomgi. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Lok man ongene bot jo ma gin bedo i Epeco ducu, Lujudaya ki Lugrik bene. Ci lworo omakogi ducu, ci guworo nying Rwot Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Lwak jo madong guye Yecu gubino kun gin ngut atyer ikom tim tyetgi ducu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Ki jo mayam timo tic tangotango gukelo buk tyetgi guguru kacel guwangogi woko inyim lwak ducu. Ka kikwano welgi ci kinongo ni romo lim ryal alip pyere abic kulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lim ryal acel culu lapakaca ma ikin gang pi nino acel. </char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Kitmeno lok pa Rwot odongo omede ki kero madwong.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tubu dano ma otime i Epeco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Lacen ki inge meno, Paulo otamo ki i cwinye me cito i Makedonia ki i Akaya ka ekat kwede i Jerucalem, kun waco ni, “Myero acit anen wa Roma bene.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ci ocwalo lukonye aryo i Makedonia, Temceo ki Eracto; en kikome odong i Acia pi kare manok.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ikare meno atubatuba magwa ocake ikom Yo pa Rwot. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Laco mo ma nyinge Demetrio latet ryal, yam teto ryal timo kwede cal ot jok ma dako ma nyinge Atemi makelo kwede lim madwong bot ludiro tice. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />En ocokogi ogurugi kacel ki jo mukene ma gin tiyo kit tic acelu, ci owaco botgi ni, “Lutuwa, wun wungeyo ni lonyowa a i tic man. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Dong wuneno dok wuwinyo bene ni Paulo man tye ka bito dano, pe i Epeco keken ento oromo i Acia ducu. Tye kaloko jo mapol me lubu kore, kun tito botgi ni lubangagu ma kitiyo ki cing pe gin lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Tye ni gin marac binen, pe ikom ticwa man keken ma kilanyo pire, ento wa ot me woro lubangawa madit. Atemi, bene pire dong biboto woko, ki deyone bene kibikwanyo woko. En Atemi ma dano i lobo Acia ki me lobo ducu giworoni.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ka guwinyo lok man ci gutware malo ki kiniga gucako wo matek ni, “Atemi pa jo Epeco dit mada.” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kitmeno taun madit meno iye orube woko; gin ducu guringo i kabedo kama kinyutu iye tuku kun giywayo Gayo ki Aristako, Lumakedonia mayam guwoto kacel ki Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo onongo mito cito ka donyo i dye lwak, ento lupwonye pe guye. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Ludito me lobo Acia mogo bene ma gin lureme gucwalo lok bote ni pe otem donyo i kabedo me nyutu tuku. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Jo mogo gudange mapat ki jo mogo guloko pat, pien lwak mucoke ducu dong gukeco woko, pol pa dano bene pe gingeyo lok ma ogurugi kacel. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Jo mogo ma i lwak gutamo ni loke otiko Alekijanda, pien Lujudaya gukete inyim lwak ma ocoke, ci Alekijanda ojukugi ki cinge kun mito pido lok inyim lwak. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ento ka guniang ni en Lajudaya, gucako wo awoya ci gudange ki dwon acel pi cawa aryo kulu ni, “Atemi pa Jo Epeco dit mada.”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Lacen ladit ma en aye karan me taun madit meno ojuku dano ci owaco botgi ni, “Wun jo Epeco, anga ma pe ngeyo ni taun madit me Epeco aye lagwok ot woro Atemi madit, ki got maleng mayam opoto ki ipoloni? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Lok man pyem mo peke iye, wun dong omyero wubed mot, pe wutim gin mo ki kurukuru. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Wun wukelo jo man ma pe guyako gin mo ki i ot jok, pe bene guyeto lubangawa ma dakoni. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Kace Demetrio ki lutet luwote gitye ki lok adot ikom ngat mo, otkot tye, luloyo bene gitye; wek gupide ki kunu. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ento ka tye lok mukene ma wumito, meno kibityekone i coke me kare ducu macalo cik tye. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Pien watwero poto i can pi gin ma otime tin ni kun giwaco ni watimo bwami, pien pe tye tyen lok mo ma watwero nyutu pi kit wo ma otime tin.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Ka otyeko loko lok man, ci oketo ocoke woko.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ocito i Makedonia ki i lobo pa jo Grik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ma dong atubatuba ogik, Paulo olwongo lupwonye bote, ocuku cwinygi, ocikogi, ka ocito woko i Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />En owok ki i dye lobo meno kun cuko cwiny dano ki lok mapol, ka oo i lobo pa jo Grik. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Otyeko dwe adek kunu, ento ka oyube me kwango nam pi cito i Ciria, Lujudaya gupiro lok ikome, ci Paulo omoko tame ni dong ebidok ewok ki i Makedonia. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Copater wod pa Piro me Berea olwoke, kacel ki Aristako ki Cekundo Lutecalonika, ki Gayo Laderobe, ki Temceo, kacel ki jo Acia, Tukiko ki Tropimo. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Gin gucito anyim, gukuruwa i Teroa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Wan wakwang waa ki i Pilipi ma nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye dong okato, ka wakwang pi nino abic ci wao botgi i Teroa, watyeko kunu nino abiro.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo ociko jo Teroa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ikom nino ma okwongo me cabit, ka wacoke kacel ka nywako icamo mugati, Paulo obedo kalok kwedgi pien onongo mito wot woko odiko; ci oloko pi kare malac nio wa i cwiny dyewor. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Mac tara mapol obedo kalyel i kicika kama wacoke iyeni. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Onongo tye awobi mo ma nyinge Yutiko ma obedo iwang dirica. Ikare ma Paulo orii kalok, ci nino onuru awobinu mada, ci opoto piny nia ki i ot me adeke, ci kitinge ma oto woko. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Ka Paulo olor piny, ci oryebe ikome okwake, owaco ni, “Pe cwinywu opoti, kwone pud tye.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ka Paulo oito odok malo, ka obaro i mugati ci gucamo. Obedo kalok kwedgi nio kwarpiny, ka opoke kwedgi. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Gucito ki awobi meno makwo, cwinygi obedo yom matek.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo oa ki i Teroa ocito Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Wan watelo yo wadonyo i mel, ci wakwang wao i Acco ma wageno ni Paulo bidonyo i mel ki kunu, pien onongo en ociko kitmeno. Paulo onongo oyubu me wok ki iwi tura. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Ka oromo kwedwa i Acco, ci wagamo en i mel, wacito kwede wa i Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ka wakwang waa ki kunu ci orwone wakemo Kioc; ka orwone mukene wao wa Camoc, inge nino meno wao i Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pien Paulo onongo omoko ni ebikwang ewok kun ekato Epeco akata, wek pe etyek kare i Acia, pien onongo nene rune wek ebed i Jerucalem ka twere inino me Pentekote.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo oloko ki ludongo me Epeco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ikare ma Paulo tye i Mileto, ocwalo kwena i Epeco pi lwongo ludongo pa lwak ma oye Kricito wek gubin bote. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ka gin dong guo bote, ci en owaco botgi ni, “Wun ki komwu wungeyo kit mayam abedo kwede ikinwu wun ducu, nia ikare ma tyena okwongo nyono lobo Acia, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />kun atiyo pi Rwot ki mwolo ducu, ki pig wang, ki ayela mupoto ikoma pi Lujudaya ma gupiro lok ikoma. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />An yam pe anguny adok kingeya aweko tucu lok mo botwu matwero konyowu, kun apwonyowu i dye lwak ki i ot ki ot. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Atito atyer botwu Lujudaya ki bot jo Grik bene ni myero gungut ikom balgi, gudwog cen bot Lubanga, ci guye Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Kombedi an dong abicito i Jerucalem, ma an lamabuc ma Cwiny Maleng aye otita, kun pe angeyo gin ma bipoto ikoma ki kunu. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />I ada ne Cwiny Maleng aye obedo ka tita ki i taun madito ducu ni twec ki can madwong aye tye ka kura. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ento kwona dong pe obedo gin me wel ki tung bota, pe pire dong dit ki bota, ento myero an dong acob ngweca keken ki dogtic ma alimo ki bot Rwotwa Yecu, me tito lok me Kwena Maber me kica pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Kombedi dong angeyo ni wun ducu mayam abedo kawot ikinwu kun apwonyowu ki lok ikom ker pa Lubanga pe dong wubineno wanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ma omiyo atito botwu tin atyer ni, ka kwo pa ngat mo ikinwu orwenyo, aline pe tye iwiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Pien pe anguny adok kingeya aweko tucu botwu gin ducu ma Lubanga oyubu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Wugwoke kekenwu ki dwol romiwu ducu ma Cwiny Maleng oketowu me bedo lugwokone, wek wukwa lwak pa Lubanga ma en owilogi ki remo me wel madwong pa Wode. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Angeyo ni ka apoke woko kwedwu, orudi mager bidonyo ikinwu ci pe gibitimo kica bot romi. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Dok ikin wun ki komwu bene bia iye jo ma gibiloko lok ma ngako dano ci gibwolo luye miyo gilubu korgi. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ma omiyo acikowu ni wugwoke, kun wupo ni yam abedo ka pwonyo ngat acel acel ikinwu ma pe aling pi mwaka adek kulu dyeceng ki dyewor kun akok ki pig wanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Kombedi dong amiyowu i cing Lubanga ki i loke me kica matwero miyo wudongo wubedo matek, miyo wunongo dulwu ki ikom gin ma Lubanga oyube me miyo bot jo ducu ma en olonyogi gudoko maleng. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />An yam cwinya pe opuke ikom lim pa ngat mo kadi ki ginarukane. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Wungeyo kekenwu ni anongo gin ducu mamite pira ki pi jo ma atye kwedgi ki tic ma atiyo ki cinga eni. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ikare ducu atyeko nyutu botwu ni pi tiyo tic matek macalo meno myero wakony lugoro kun wapo lok pa Rwotwa Yecu mayam owaco ni, ‘Miyo mot kelo gum makato gamo agama.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ka otyeko loko lok meno, ci Paulo orumu conge piny olego kwedgi ducu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Gin ducu gukok kun gikwako ngut Paulo ki mot me mar. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Gin ma ocwero cwinygi tutwal makato ducu obedo lok ma en owaco botgi ni pe dok gibineno wange. Ci gulwoke wa i mel.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ocito i Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ma dong wapoke kwedgi, wacako kwang wakemo yo atir nio wa i Koc. Orwone wao i Rodec, ka dok wa a ki kunu wao i Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Ka wanongo mel ki kunu ma cito Poiniki, ci wadonyo iye, wacako wot. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Ka dong wao kama waneno Caiprac, ci wa kwang wadok tung piny, wacito wa i lobo Ciria ka wakato woko iwi tura i Turu, pien onongo omyero kikwany yec woko ki i mel ki kunu. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Wayenyo jo ma oye ci wari kunu nino abiro. Cwiny Maleng onongo otiyo kwedgi me juku Paulo ni pe ocit i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ka dong kare me wotwa oromo, ci wapoke kwedgi wamede ki wotwa. Gin ducu gulwokowa, mon wa lutino, ci gukelowa wa inge taun madit; ka warumu congwa i dog nam, ci walego, wacike kwedgi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Lacen wan wadonyo i mel, ci gin gudok paco.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ma watyeko kwang nia ki i Turu, ci wao i Potolemai; ka wamoto utmego, ci wabedo kwedgi pi nino acel. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Tic 6:5</ref></char></note> Orwone wapoke kwedgi, wacito i Cecaria. Wadonyo i ot pa Pilipo latit lok me Kwena Maber, mayam en ngat acel ikin jo abiro ca ma kiyero me konyo luye i Jerucalem, ci wabedo bote. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Yam en tye ki anyirane angwen ma pe kinyomogi, mayam gitito lok me nebi pa Lubanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Tic 11:28</ref></char></note> Ka wadike i Pilipo pi nino mapolpol, lanebi mo ma nyinge Agabo obino kunu nia ki i Judaya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />En obino botwa ci okwanyo del pyer Paulo ka otweyo ki tyene ki cinge kekene kun waco ni, “Cwiny Maleng owaco kit man ni, ‘Lujudaya ma i Jerucalem gibitweyo won del pyer man kit man, ci kibimiye i cing Lurok.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ka wawinyo lok man, ci wan ki jo ma kunu walego Paulo ni pe ocit i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Paulo odok iye ni, “Wun wumito gin ango, ma wukok wubalo ki cwinyani? An pe ayube pi buc keken, ento wa pi to i Jerucalem pi nying Rwot Yecu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Ka dong pe oye, ci waweke kun wawaco ni, “Gin ma Rwot mito myero otime.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ka kare meno, ci wayube me cito i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Wawoto ki lupwonye mogo ma gua ki i Cecaria, guwoto kwedwa nia ki kunu ci guterowa wa i ot pa Munacon dano me Caiprac, en obedo dano ma yam odoko lapwonye wa con, dok orii iye pi kare malac.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo olimo Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ka wao i Jerucalem, utmego gujolowa ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Orwone Paulo ocito kwedwa bot Yakobo ma onongo ludongo ducu gitye. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Ka dong omotogi, Paulo otito kore ki kore gin mapol ma Lubanga otiyo ikin Lurok pi tice. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ka guwinyo, gupako Lubanga. Ci guwaco bote ni, “Kong inen, ominwa, tye Lujudaya alip adi ma gitye ikin jo madong guye Kricito. Gin ducu gumine tutwal kalubu Cik pa Moses. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Gin gubedo kawinyo lok ikomi ni ipwonyo Lujudaya ducu ma gitye ikin Lurok ni gubwot Cik pa Moses woko, dok bene ni itito lok botgi kilong ni pe gulir lutinogi, dok pe gulub kitwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Gin ango dong ma myero watim? Pien gin gibiwinyo ni in ibino Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Wel 6:13-21</ref></char></note> Piman myero dong i tim gin ma waciki. Watye ki jo angwen kany mayam gukwongo kwong. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ter jo meno ci ilonye kwedgi kacel, ci icul lim mamite pirgi, wek gulyel wigi. Kitmeno dano ducu gibingeyo ni lok ma gibedo kaloko ikomi ni pe kakare, ento in bene itye ka gwoko Cik pa Moses. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Tic 15:29</ref></char></note> Ento pi tung bot Lurok ma guye Rwot watyeko cwalo waraga botgi ki lok ma wangolo ni, pe gucam gin ma kityero bot jogi, pe gucam remo, ki ringo lee ma kideyo adeya, gukwer bene tim tarwang.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Paulo otero jo meno ci orune olonye kacel kwedgi, ka en ocito i Ot pa Lubanga pi nyutu kare mene ma nino me lonye megi dong bitum, wek kityer tyer pirgi ki acel acel.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimako Paulo i Ot pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ka onongo nino abiro me lonyegi dong cok tum, Lujudaya ma gua ki i Acia guneno Paulo i Ot pa Lubanga. Gin gutugu lwak ducu, ci gumake. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Kun gidange matek ni, “Wun jo Icrael, wumii kony. Man aye laco matye ka pwonyo dano i kabedo ducu ki pwony marac, me kwero rokwa ki Cik pa Moses ki kabedo man bene. Ki makato ducu en okelo Lugrik bene i Ot pa Lubanga, opyedo kabedo man maleng woko.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Tic 20:4</ref></char></note> (Pien onongo guneno Tropimo ma Laepeco ma gitye kacel kwede Paulo i taun madit, ci gutamo ni Paulo okele i Ot pa Lubanga.) <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Ci dano ocako wo i taun madit gutware woko, kun guringo kacel. Gumako Paulo, guywaye woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga, ci kiloro dogola woko cut. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ma kimito neke woko, ento lok oo bot kapten me mony ni Jerucalem dong otuge woko. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />En olaro kunu ki ngwec ki lumony mapol kacel ki luditogi maloyo dano miya ki miya, ci gujuku lugo Paulo. Ka lwak guneno kapten ki lumony, ci guweko goyo Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Kapten ocito ka omake, ci ociko ni kitweye ki nyor aryo. Ka openyo lwak ni en anga, dok obalo gin ango? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Jo mogo ma gitye ikin lwak gudange ni piman, ki mukene ni piman. Ka kapten dong pe oniang ikom loke kikome pi wo ma obedo madwong, ci ociko ni kitere i gogo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Ka guo i rwom me ito malo, lumony gutingo Paulo atinga pi gero pa lwak. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Pien lwak dano ma otube gulubu korgi kun gidange ni, “Wuneke woko!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo opido inyim lwak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ikare ma onongo gidonyo ki Paulo i gogo, Paulo owaco bot kapten ni, “Atwero loko lok mo boti?” Ci kapten ogamo ni, “In ingeyo leb Grik? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Pe in aye Laejipt mayam otubu dano ci otero lunek alip angwen woko i tim?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo ogamo ni, “An Lajudaya, kinywala i Taruco ma i Cilicia, gang ma ngene mada. Alegi miya alok ki lwak.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Ka oye, Paulo ocung i rwom ci ojuku lwak ki cinge. Ka piny oling litik, Paulo ocako lok kwedgi i leb Ibru kun waco ni:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Utmego ki wego, wuwiny pido ma akelo inyimwu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Ka guwinyo en kaloko kwedgi i leb Ibru, gumede ki ling mot, ci Paulo omede ki loke:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:34">Tic 5:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note> An Lajudaya, kinywala i Taruco i Cilicia, ento adongo i taun madit man me Jerucalem, lapwonya obedo Gamaliel. Kipwonya ki Cik pa kwarowa kun amiine bene tutwal me lubu Cik; dok abedo ki nyeko pi Lubanga macalo wun bene wutye kwede tin. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> Abedo kalibo jo me Yo man, anekogi bene. Atweyogi, aterogi wa i mabuc, co ki mon; <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ki kacoke pa ludongo gin aye cadena ikom lok man. Alimo waraga ki botgi pi utmego, ci acako wot me cito i Damaciko kamako jo ma gitye kunu ki tweyogi me akela kany i Jerucalem wek kiket can ikomgi.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo otito kit ma en eloke kwede eye Yecu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Tic 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ikare ma atye kawot madong anyiko cok ki Damaciko, i cwiny dyeceng, ci dero madit oa ki ipolo, oryeny ocaro koma. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ka apoto piny, ci awinyo dwon ma waca ni, <char style="wj">“ ‘Caulo, Caulo, pingo itye ka yela?’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />An agamo ni, ‘In anga, Rwot?’ Ci owaca ni, <char style="wj">‘An aye Yecu me Najaret ma itye ka yelani.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Jo ma guwoto kweda guneno dero, ento pe guwinyo dwon ngat matye kalok kwedani. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ci agamo ni, ‘Atim gin ango, Rwot?’ Ci Rwot owaca ni, <char style="wj">‘A malo iciti idony i Damaciko, ci kibititi ki kunu gin ducu mayam kiyubu ni myero itii.’ </char> <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kit macalo onongo dong pe aneno piny pi dero meno ma ocaro wanga, ci jo ma gitye kweda gupeya ki cinga nio wa i Damaciko.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ngat mo ma nyinge Anania, dano ma woro Lubanga kun lubu cike ducu, ma Lujudaya ducu ma gitye kunu giloko nyinge maber, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />obino bota, ci ocung ka ngeta, owaca ni, ‘Omera Caulo, wek wangi dong oyabe!’ Ci wanga oyabe woko i cawa meno cut, ci aneno kome. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />En owaca ni, ‘Lubanga pa kwarowa oyero in wek inge gin ma en mito, inen Ngat ma Kite Atir, iwinye bene ka en loko ki doge. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Pien in i bibedo cadene bot dano ducu pi gin ma ineno ki ma iwinyo. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Man dok pud ikuru gin ango? Dong ia malo kibatija in, kilwok bali woko kun ilwongo nyinge.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ooro Paulo bot Lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Ka atyeko dwogo i Jerucalem, ikare ma atye kalega i Ot pa Lubanga, awile woko, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />ci anene. En owaca ni, <char style="wj">‘Rune oyot, i a woko ki i Jerucalem, pien pe gibiye lok me caden ma itito pira.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Agamo ni, ‘Rwot, gin ki komgi gingeyo ni i kacoke acel acel abedo ka pwodo dano ma guye in, atweyogi bene ibuc. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Tic 7:58</ref></char></note> Dok ikare ma kineko lacaden ni Citefano an onongo acung kunu apwoyo gin ma otime, dok agwoko bene bongi pa jo ma guneke.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Ci Rwot owaca ni, <char style="wj">‘A woko ki kany, pien abicwali kamabor bot Lurok.’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Gin lwak gubedo kawinyo Paulo nio wa i lok man; ento ka dong en oloko, ci gucako dange ki dwon malongo ni, “Wutere, wuneke woko! Dano macalo meno pe romo bedo i lobo!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Gubedo ka dange matek, ma gitengo bongigi, gidunyo apwa malo. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Kapten ociko ni kiter Paulo i gogo, ci gupenye kun gipwode ki del wek guniang gin ma omiyo kidange ikome kitmeno. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Ento ka dong kityeko tweye ki del, Paulo oloko ki ladit maloyo dano miya ma ocung ka ngete ni, “Cik ye ni kipwod dano ma Laroma ma peya kingolo kop oloye bo?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ka ladit meno owinyo, ci ocito bot kapten, owace ni, “Man ibitimo ningning? Dano man Laroma.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ci kapten obino bot Paulo openye ni, “In Laroma?” En ogamo ni, “Eyo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Kapten owaco ni, “An awilo dit man ki lwak lim mabup.” Paulo owaco ni, “Ento an kinywala kwede anywala.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Jo ma gubedo kapenyeni gugware gucito woko cut. Kapten bene obedo ki lworo, pien oniang ni Paulo bene Laroma ma onongo etweyoni.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo inyim lumemba me Otkot madit pa Lujudaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Orwone ka kapten omito ni eniang tyen lok kikome ma Lujudaya gudoto iye Pauloni, ci ogonye woko, ka ociko ni ajwaki madito ki lumemba me Otkot ducu myero gugure kacel. Ka otero Paulo oketo inyimgi.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo ociko wange ikom lumemba me Otkot mucoke ci owaco ni, “Utmego, an abedo ma cwinya leng inyim Lubanga nio wa ikare man.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ka owaco man, Anania, Ajwaka madit, ociko jo ma gucung ka nget Paulo ni gudong doge. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mat 23:27</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:28">28</ref></char></note> Paulo owaco bote ni, “Lubanga bene bidongi, in kor ot ma kipuyu matari! In ibedo ka ngola kop ite Cik, dok bene iciko ni kidonga labongo lubu Cik?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Jo ma gucung ka ngete guwaco ni, “In iyeto Ajwaka madit pa Lubanga?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Nia 22:28</ref></char></note> Paulo ogamo ni, “Utmego, pe onongo angeyo ni en Ajwaka madit; pien kicoyo ni, ‘Pe ilok marac ikom ladit maloyo lwak.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">Tic 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Pili 3:5</ref></char>
    </note> Ento ka Paulo oniang ni dul acel ikin gi Lucadukayo ki dul mukene ikin gi Luparicayo, ci odange i Otkot ni, “Utmego, an Laparicayo, wod pa Luparicayo. Lok opoto ikoma pi geno lok me nicer pa jo ma oto.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Ka owaco lok man, pyem opoto ikin Luparicayo ki Lucadukayo, nio ka Otkot iye opoke woko. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mat 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk 20:27</ref></char></note> Pien Lucadukayo gin waco ni cer pa jo ma oto pe, kadi lamalaika, kadi cwiny mo peke; ento Luparicayo giye ducu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ka pyem omede matek, Lupwonycik ma i dul pa Luparicayo gutware malo ka guwaco ni, “Pe wanongo kop mo ma danoni obalo. Ka ce cwiny onyo lamalaika aye oloko kwede, ci timo ango?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ka pyem otede magwa, kapten olworo ni gin biyeco Paulo woko atata, ka dok ociko lumony ni gulor piny gin gukwanye woko ki ikin gi ki tek, ci gukete i gogo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Orwone i dyewor, Rwot ocung ka nget Paulo, ci owace ni, <char style="wj">“Di cwinyi. Macalo ibedo katito lok ikoma i Jerucalem, kitmeno bene myero ibed cadena wa i Roma.”</char><verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiyubu lok me neko Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ka piny oru, Lujudaya mogo gutudo dogi kacel kun gukwongo ni pe gibicamo cam kadi wa mato pii nio ka kineko Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Jo ma gukwonge kitmeno onongo welgi kato pyere angwen. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ka gucito bot ajwaki madito ki ludongo guwaco ni, “Wan watyeko kwonge matek ma watweyo ni pe wabibilo cam mo nio ka waneko Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Pimeno wun ki lumemba me Otkot wucwal lok kombedi bot kapten wek okele piny botwu macalo wubicito ka ngiyo kop ikome kore ki kore. Nongo wan wayube me neke ma peya oo botwu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ento okeyo Paulo owinyo kit ma kitye kapiro lok kwede ikome, ci ocito odonyo i gogo otito ki Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ka Paulo olwongo ladit mony acel ma lalo dano miya, ci owace ni, “Ter awobi man bot kapten. En tye ki lok mo ma mito tito bote.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Otere bot kapten ci owace ni, “Paulo ma lamabuci olwonga ci olega ni akel awobi man boti, pien tye ki lok mo ma mito tito boti.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kapten omako cinge, otere cen i mung ka openye ni, “Gin ango ma onongo i mito tito bota?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Ogamo ni, “Lujudaya guyube me penyi wek iter Paulo botgi i Otkot diki, wek onen calo gimito ni gimed penyo lok ikome wek giniang iye maber. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ento pe iye legagi, pien dano makato pyere angwen gubutu ka kiye. Gukwonge ni pe gibicamo gin mo kadi mato pii nio ka gineko Paulo. Kombedi dong guyube, gikuru cik ma a ki boti.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Kapten ocwalo awobinu kun cike ni, “Pe dok itit bot ngat mo ni itito lok man bota.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicwalo Paulo bot Pwelici ma laloyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ci olwongo lumony aryo ma lulo dano miya ki miya, owaco botgi ni, “Wuyube ikin cawa adek me dyewor ki acikari miya aryo, ki wegi aguragura pyere abiro, ki wegi tong miya aryo wek gucit Cecaria. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Dok inong aguragura bene pi Paulo wek oring kwede wek itere ki kuc bot Pwelici laloyo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ci ocoyo waraga ma kwane kit man:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“An Kalaudio Licia amoto in Laloyo Maber Pwelici. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Laco man Lujudaya aye gumako, onongo dong gicok neke woko, ka acito botgi ki lumony ci alare ki i cinggi, pien onongo aniang ni en Laroma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Pi mito niang ikom lok ma kidote iye ci atere i Otkot ma meggi. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ci anongo ni kidote ki adot ma dok ikom cikgi, pe onongo tye lok mo ma kiromo ngolo kop me to iye ikome, kadi bene me tweye ibuc. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ka kikwila lok ni ki tye ka kiyo laco man, ci acwale woko oyot kun aciko ludote ni gutit adotgi ma ikome inyimi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Lumony gulubu twero ma kimiyogi ci gutero Paulo kit ma kicikogi kwede. Gukwanye ki i dyewor gutere wa i Antipatric. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Orwone gudwogo i gogo, kun giweko wegi aguragura gumede ki wot kwede. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Ka guo Cecaria gumiyo waraga bot laloyo, ci gutero Paulo bene inyime. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Ikare ma laloyo dong okwano waraga, openye ni en oa i lobo mene. Ka oniang ni oa i lobo Cilicia, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ci owaco ni, “Abiwinyo loki ka ludoti guo.” Ociko ni kigwoke i ot madit pa Kerode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ma kidoto ki Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ka nino abic okato, ajwaka madit Anania obino ki ludongo mogo, kacel ki lapilida mo ma nyinge Tertulo, ci gutero adotgi inyim laloyo pi doto Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Ka dong kilwongo Paulo, ci Tertulo ocako adote kun waco ni:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Laloyo Maber, ladit Pwelici, wabedo ki kuc piri nia wa con, dok itamo pi rokwa, ikelo alokaloka mapol ma okonyowa <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />ikit yo ducu ki i kabedo ducu, wan bene wajolo ki yomcwiny madwong, ladit. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ento pe dong agal wii, abako doga boti pi kicani iwiny lokwa ma cegocegoni. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Wanongo ni dano man lanek piny, en aye lakel jemo ikin Lujudaya ducu ma i lobo ducu, en latel wi dul pa Lunajaret. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />En bene otemo pyedo wa Ot pa Lubanga madite, ci wamake woko. [Onongo wamito ngolo kop ikome kun walubu cikwa ni, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />ento kapten Licia obino omaye woko ki i cingwa tektek, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />ci ociko ni ludote omyero guo inyimi.] Ka in ki komi ipenye, ibiniang ki bote lok ducu ma wadote iye.”<verse eid="ACT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Lujudaya bene guribe i adot meno, kun gimoko ni lok man ducu tye kitmeno.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo opido loke inyim Pwelici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ka laloyo ocime ni oloki, Paulo odok iye ni, “Ladit, angeyo ni ibedo kangolo kop i rok man pi mwaka malac, ma omiyo apido loka inyimi ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Macalo in bene itwero nongo ka ipenyo dano, wel nino ma okato nia ikare ma acito i Jerucalem ka woro Lubanga peya okato apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Pe ginongo ni atye ka pyem ki dano mo, nyo tubu lwak, kadi i Ot pa Lubanga, nyo i kacoke me lega, nyo i dye taun madit. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Dok bene pe gitwero nyutu ni lok ma gikelo ikoma kombedi tye kakare. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ento aye lok man boti ni, aworo Lubanga pa kwarowa kun alubu kit Yo ma gin kilwongo ni dul. Aye lok ducu ma kicoyo i Cik pa Moses ki i buk pa lunebi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Pi niyena ikom Lubanga atye ki gen ni dano gibicer woko, jo ma kitgi atir wa ki jo ma kitgi pe atir, wa gin bene gitye ki kit gen acelu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Pimeno an bene atemo mada kare ducu wek abed ma cwinya leng inyim Lubanga ki inyim dano.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:27-28">Tic 21:27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ma dong abedo cen pi mwaka mapolpol acito i Jerucalem ka tero mot bot jo me roka pi konyo lucan, ki ka tyero gitum. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Ikare ma atye katiyo man, gunonga i Ot pa Lubanga madong atyeko lonye woko ikit mamite. Pe abedo ki lwak mo dok wo bene obedo pe. Ento Lujudaya mogo ma gua ki i Acia onongo bene gitye. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Gin aye onongo omyero gubed kany inyimi wek gukel adotgi, ka gitye ki lok mo ikoma. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Nyo wek jo man ki komgi gunyut gin marac ma gunongo ikoma ikare ma acung inyim jo me Otkot. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tic 23:6</ref></char></note> Tye lok man keken, ikare ma acung ikin gi adange ni, ‘Pi lok kom cer pa jo ma oto aye omiyo wutye kangolo lok ikoma tin.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ento Pwelici obedo kingec ma oromo ikom Yo pa Rwot, ci pe otyeko lok woko cut. Owaco ni, “Abingolo kopwu ka kapten Licia bibino kany.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Ka ociko ladit mony maloyo dano miya ni omyero ogwok Paulo ibuc ento obed labongo ayela mo, pe gigeng lureme ka gimito mine kony.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo inyim Pwelici ki Drucila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ka kare okato manok, Pwelici obino ki dakone Drucila ma anyira Judaya. Olwongo Paulo, ci obedo ka winye kaloko lok me niye ikom Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Ikare ma en tye kalok ikom kit ma atir ki gwoke kekene, ki ngolo kop ma bibedo ikare me anyim, lworo omako Pwelici omiyo owaco ni, “Kong dong iciti; ka dok anongo kare ci abilwongi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Onongo bene en geno ni Paulo bimiye lim, pieno obedo ka lwonge jwijwi ci boko lok kwede. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ento ka mwaka aryo okato, Porcio Festo oleyo katyen Pwelici. Pwelici onongo mito ni Lujudaya gupwoye, omiyo oweko Paulo ibuc.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okoko apil ni omyero kiter loke inyim laloc madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ikare ma Festo obino i lobo ma kimiye ni en oloo, inge nino adek, en oa ki i Cecaria, ocito i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludito me lobo Judaya gutite pi lok ikom Paulo, ci gubako dogi bote <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />ni otim ber oye ocwal Paulo i Jerucalem, kun onongo guyubu ni dano gibikiye ci gineke woko i wanga yoo. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ento Festo ogamo ni kitye kagwoko Paulo i Cecaria, en bene emito dok kunu ikare macoki. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ci owaci, “Pimeno, jo ma ikinwu ma gitye ki twero myero gucit kweda. Ka onongo roc mo tye ikom laco meno, wek gudote bota.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Festo obedo i Jerucalem pi nino maromo aboro nyo apar, ka odok i Cecaria. Orwone obedo ikom me ngolo kop, ci ociko ni gikel Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ka dong obino, Lujudaya ma gua i Jerucalem gucung ma gurume dyere, gudote ki lwak adot mapol mapek ma pe gitwero moko kite. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulo opido ni, “Peya abalo lok mo ikom Cik pa Lujudaya kadi Ot pa Lubanga, kadi wa bot laloc madit Cecar.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ento Festo onongo mito ni Lujudaya gupwoye, ci owaco bot Paulo ni, “Imito giteri i Jerucalem wek angol kop ikomi pi adot magi ki kunu?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo ogamo ni, “Acung kany inyim kom me ngolo kop pa Cecar, en aye kama myero gingola iye kop. Pe abalo bal mo bot Lujudaya, meno in bene ingeyo maber. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Ka abalo bal ma roma to, lok mo pe, gitwero neka, pe akwero; ento ka adotgi ikoma tere pe, ci pe tye ngat mo matwero miya i cinggi. Akoko apil bot Cecar.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Ka Festo otyeko poro lok ki lumemba me Otkot ma mege ci, odok iye ni, “Ikoko apil bot Cecar; ibicito bot Cecar.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo inyim Agripa ki Bernike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ka nino okato manok, rwot Agripa ki Bernike guo i Cecaria ci Festo ojolo gi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ka gudike kunu pi kare malac, Festo oketo adot ma kikelo ikom Paulo inyim rwot kun waco ni, “Tye laco mo kany ma Pwelici oweko ibuc. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ikare ma atye i Jerucalem, ajwaki madito pa Lubanga ki ludongo pa Lujudaya gutita lok ikome, ci gulega ni angol ni kop oloye. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Adok iye botgi ni, pe obedo kitwa wan Luroma me miyo dano mo i cing ludote ma peya kimiye kare me cung inyimgi wang ki wang wek opid pidone ikom lok ma kidote iye. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ka gubino kany, ci an bene pe adike, ento orwone abedo ikom me ngolo kop ci aciko ni kikele. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ka ludote gua kalok, pe gukelo adot mo ikome ma mako bal mo marac, macalo yam atamo; <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />ento gubedo ka laro lok kwede ma dok ikom dinigi, ki ikom ngat mo ma nyinge Yecu mayam oto, ma Paulo waco ni tye makwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Yeko telok macalo meno oloya, ma omiyo apenye ka en mito cito i Jerucalem wek kicingol loke ki kunu. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ento Paulo okoko apil ni omyero kigwoke ibuc pi kuru ngolo kop pa laloc madit ma won deyoni. Ci aciko ni kigwoke nio ka abicwale bot Cecar.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agripa owaco bot Festo ni, “An kikoma amito winyo lok pa danonu ka twere.” En ogamo ni, “Diki ibiwinyo loke.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Orwone Agripa ki Bernike gucito ki deyo madwong, ci gudonyo i kicika me winyo ngolo kop kacel ki kapten mogo me mony ki jo ma gingene ma i gang meno. Ka Festo ociko, ci gikelo Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Festo owaco ni, “Rwot Agripa ki wun ducu ma wutye kwedwa kany, wun dong wuneno dano man ma lwak Lujudaya ducu gubako dogi bota pire i Jerucalem wa ki kany bene, kun gidange ni pe myero obed kwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Ento an pe anongo otimo gin mo maromo miyo kingole kop me to. Dong macalo en aye gire okoko apil pi laloc madit, an bene amoko ni abicwale. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ento peya atye ki lok mo kikome ma myero aco ikome bot rwoda, en gin ma omiyo akele inyimwu, ki makato ne inyimi, in Rwot Agripa, wek ka wabipenye abed ki lok mo me acoya. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Pien aneno ni konye mo pe me cwalo lamabuc ka pe ginyutu lok mo ma atir ikome.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo opido loke inyim Agripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agripa owaco bot Paulo ni, “Kiye ni ilok giri piri keni.” Ci Paulo oryeyo bade ka ocako pidone ma lube kuman:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Ladit, tin koma gum mada me cung inyimi, in rwot Agripa, pi pido loka ikom lok ducu ma Lujudaya gudota iye. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Makato ducu pien in ingeyo maber tutwal kit pa Lujudaya ducu ki lok ma gilaro ikin gi ken gi; pimeno alegi ni idi cwinyi wek iwiny loka mot ma cwinyi opye.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Lujudaya ducu gingeyo kit kwona nia ka tinona. Pi kwona ducu, cake i acakine, abedo ikin rokwa ki i Jerucalem bene. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tic 23:6</ref></char></note> Gingeyo nia wa con, ka giye tucu ne, ni abedo kalubu kit pa lugwok dini matek makato ma ikinwa, ma gin aye Luparicayo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kombedi acung kany ka pido kopa pi geno cike ma Lubanga omiyo bot kwariwa, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />pi geno gin ma kakawa apar wiye aryo ducu gigeno ni gibinongo, kun giworo Lubanga ki cwinygi ducu dyewor ki dyeceng. Lujudaya gitye ka pida pi gen man, ai rwot, macalo obedo bal! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Pingo pe wutwero ye ni Lubanga cero jo ma oto?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> Kadi wa an bene yam atamo ni myero atii matek me lweny ikom nying Yecu me Najaret. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Yam atimo kitmeno i Jerucalem; ci atweyo jo pa Lubanga mapol ibuc kun atiyo ki twer ma anongo ki bot ajwaki madito. An ki koma abolo kwir wek ki nekgi ka onongo ki ngolo lok me to iwigi. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Tyen mapol aketo can ikomgi i kacoke ducu, kun atemo diyo gi ki tek me yeto nying Kricito; dok agere ikomgi, ayelogi wa i taun madito pa lurok.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo otito kit ma en eloke kwede bot Kricito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Tic 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Kitmeno awoto Damaciko kun atye ki twero ki cik ma ajwaki madito gumiya. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />I cwiny dyeceng, ai rwot, aneno ki i wanga yoo ka dero a ki ipolo maryeny matar makato ceng; oryeny oboyo koma dyere ki jo ma guwoto kweda bene. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Wan ducu wapoto piny, ci awinyo dwon ma loko kweda i leb Ibru ni, <char style="wj">‘Caulo, Caulo, iyela pingo? Itye kaketo ret ikomi keni, macalo twon ma gweyo dim.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Agamo ni, ‘In anga, Rwot?’ Ci Rwot owaco ni, <char style="wj">‘An aye Yecu ma itye kayelani.’</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" /><char style="wj">Ento a icung, pien anen boti pi lok man pi keti ibed latica ki lacaden pi gin ma ineno ma dok ikoma, ki pi gin ma ibineno ka dok anyute boti ikare me anyim.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" /><char style="wj">Abilari ki bot jo me rokwu, ki bot Lurok bene ma abiori botgi.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" /><char style="wj">Ibiyabo wanggi wek gua woko ki i colpiny, gubed i dero, gua woko ki ite twero pa Catan, guloke bot Lubanga, wek owek balgi ci gunong kabedo ikin jo ma Lubanga olonyogi gudoko jone, pi niyegi ikoma.</char><verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo otito pi tice</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Kitmeno, ai Rwot Agripa, pe akwero winyo cik ma gimiya ma oa ki ipolo, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Tic 9:20</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref></char></note> ento acako tucu lok, ma okwongo i Damaciko, ka lacen i Jerucalem ki lobo Judaya ducu ki bot Lurok bene, kun atito botgi ni myero gungut ikom balgi, ci guloke gudwog cen bot Lubanga, dok guti kit tim ma nyutu ni dong gungut. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Pi tyen lok man aye omiyo Lujudaya gumaka i Ot pa Lubanga, ci gutemo neka woko. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Nio wa ikare man abedo ka limo kony ma a ki bot Lubanga; kombedi dong acung kany pi miyo caden bot jo matino ki bot ludito. Lok ma aloko en gin ma lunebi wa ki Moses bene guwaco ni bitime keken, pe lok mo mapat, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Kor 15:20</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Ica 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note> ni Kricito ma Lubanga oyero, myero onen can, dok ni en bikwongo cer ki ikin jo ma oto wek otit bot rokwa ki bot Lurok bene pi dero ma biryeny menyogi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo otemo ywayo tam pa Agripa wek oye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Ka dong otyeko pidone kitmeno, Festo ogere ki lok ni, “Paulo, in lapoya. Kwano lok mapol mada omiyo ipo apoya.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Ento Paulo ogamo ni, “Pe an lapoya, ladit Festo, ento atye kaloko lok me ada keken kun wiya tye katic. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Rwot Agripa ngeyo lok man ducu, atwero lok bote labongo lworo mo. Angeyo ni pe tye lok mo ma okato ite, pien loke pe otime i mung. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Rwot Agripa, in iye lok pa lunebi? Angeyo ni iye lokgi.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agripa owaco bot Paulo ni, “Itamo ni iloka adok lalub Kricito pi kare manok mo kit man?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo ogamo ni, “Kadi pi kare manok nyo madwong, kono alego Lubanga ni idok macalo an, pe in keken ento wa dano ducu ma gitye kawinyo loka tin, ento labongo nyor ni aye.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />I nge meno rwot ki laloyo ki Bernike ki jo ma gubedo kwedgi gua malo. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Ka dong gucito woko, guloko keken gi ni, “Laco man pe otimo gin mo ma rome to, kadi bedo ibuc.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Ci Agripa owaco bot Festo ni, “Kono nene dano man pe okoko apil bot Cecar, kono gitwero gonye woko.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ocako wote me cito i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ma dong kimoko ni wakwang wacit i Itali, kimiyo Paulo ki lumabuc mukene i cing ladit mo ma nyinge Julio ma lalo dano miya ikin dul mony ma kilwongo ni pa Augucito. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Wadonyo i mel mo ma oa ki i Adramitio madong cok a kun kwang dok tung wangwat mogo ma i dog nam me lobo Acia. Wanywako yoo ki Aristako, Lamakedonia ma ganggi tye Tecalonika. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Orwone wao Cidon, ci Julio otimo Paulo maber mada, oye ki en me wot ka limo lureme wek gugwoke. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Wa a ki kunu, wakwang warabo nget Caiprac, pien yamo okemowa. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ka dong wangolo nam atir inget lobo Cilicia ki Pampulia, wao i Mira ma i lobo Licia. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Ki kunu ladit mony onongo mel ma oa ki i Alekijanderia ma tye kacito Itali, ci omiyo wadonyo iye. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Wakwang pi nino mapol, ci wao i Kunida ki tek. Yamo nongo ogengowa wot anyim atir, ma omiyo warabo nget Kurete cok ki Calamone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Warabo nget Kurete ki tek ka wao i kabedo ma kilwongo ni Wang Wat Mabeco, macok ki gang ma nyinge Lacea.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Watero kare malac kunu nio ka kit me wot i nam dong odoko tek. Dong kit ma nino madit me rii kec bene onongo dong okato woko ni, Paulo omiyo botgi tam, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />kun owaco ni, “Ludito, aneno ni wotwani bibedo rac ma bikelo lanye pa jami mapol, pe me yec ma kitingo i mel keken, ento wa mel kikome dok kadi wa kwowa bene.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Ento ladit mony oketo cwinye i lok pa ladit maloyo mel ki lok pa won mel, makato lok ma Paulo owaco. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Wang Wat meno nongo pe ber me bedo iye ikare me koyo, pimeno pol pa dano gutamo ni bedo ber me a ki kunu wek ka twere ki o Poinike, ma en aye wangwat me Kurete ma nyime okemo kupiny me kupotoceng ki kumalo me kupotoceng, wek giri kunu pi kare me koyo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yamo otago nam marac tutwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ikare ma yamo ma a tung acuc ocako kodo mot ma opye, ci co ma imel gutamo ni dong orwate ki tamgi. Guywayo lajuk mel woko ki i pii, ci gucako kwang gurabo Kurete macok ki tura. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ento ka kare okato manok keken, yamo lapiru mager tutwal ocoro, ma kilwongo ni Yurakwilo, okodo nia ki iwi tura. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Lapiru man omako mel, opango wiye woko ma pe dong twero kemo yamo, ci waweko mel dong woto dok kama yamo terowa malube ki kama yamo okemo. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Ka warabo nget latin cula mo ma nyinge Kauda ci watemo ki tek me laro yeya me mel man. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ka lukwang dong guywayo yeya gutingo ki i pii, gukelo i mel, ci guywayo tol mogo gutweyo te mel piny ki ite pii. Lacen guywayo bongo mamalo piny, wek yamo pe omii mel owot oyot tutwal, pien gilworo ni gwok nyo gibidonyo i kweyo me Cirtic i dog nam me Libya, ci guweko yamo otero mel kumeno. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ka dong lapiru otwago pii matek, ci orwone lutic imel gucako kwanyo jami ma i mel gubolo woko i pii. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Inino me adeke gucako bolo jami tic me mel woko i pii ki cinggi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Wari pi nino mapol ma pe waneno ceng nyo lakalatwe, yamo bene obedo ka kodo mager tutwal, ci lacen pe dong wabedo ki gen mo ni wabilare.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ka dong gurii pi kare malac ma pe gicamo cam mo, Paulo obino ocung i dyegi ci owaco ni, “Luditona, kono yam wuwinyo doga ma pe wua ki i Kurete, kono pe wapoto i can man ki lanye pa jami. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ento koni acikowu ni wudii cwinywu pien kwo pa ngat mo ikinwu pe birwenyo, ento mel aye. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Pien tin i dyewor man lamalaika pa Lubanga ma an a danone, ma an aworoni, obino ocung kangeta, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ci owaca ni, ‘Paulo, pe ibed ki lworo. In myero icung inyim Cecar; nen Lubanga dong otyeko laro kwo pa dano ducu ma itye kawot kwedgi.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Pimeno wudii cwinywu, pien an ageno Lubanga, angeyo ni bitime kit ma kiwaco botani. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ento mel aye biyoke ki cula mo.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ka nino oromo apar wiye angwen, ma yamo terowa i dye nam me Adria, i cwiny dyewor, lukwang mel gutamo ni tye lobo mo macok kwedwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ka gupimo tut me pii ci oromo puti miya acel ki pyere aryo. Ka dong kidire manok, dok giporo tut me pii ci oromo puti pyere abongwen. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Gulworo ni gwok nyo mel bicore ikom got, ci gubolo lajuk mel angwen i pii ki tung tere, ci gulego ni piny myero kong oru. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ka lukwang mel guyenyo yo me lwi woko ki i mel, ento ka dong gucwalo yeya i nam kun gitimo ma calo gimito bolo lajuk yo tung nyime. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ento Paulo owaco bot ladit mony ki bot lumony ni, “Ka pe jo man gubedo i mel; ci pe wubilare.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Kadok lumony gungolo tol yeya, guweko yeya okwang ocito.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ka piny dong mito ruu, Paulo odiyogi wek gin ducu gucam cam mo, ci owaco ni, “Tin dong nino me apar wiye angwene ma wubedo ka rii kec ma cwinywu ongabe angaba, ma pe wucamo gin mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Pimeno abako doga botwu ni wucam cam mo wek wunong teko; pien kadi wa yerwic mo acel pe birwenyo ki bot dano mo acel ikinwu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Ka dong owaco lok man, okwanyo mugati, omiyo pwoc bot Lubanga inyimgi ducu ci ocako camone. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ka gin ducu cwinygi odoko tek ci gucamo cam pirgi ken gi. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Onongo wan ducu ma wabedo i mel waromo dano miya aryo ki pyere abiro wiye abicel. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ka dong gucamo guyeng, ci dong guyako jami woko ki i mel kun gibolo ngano woko i nam.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mel otur woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ka piny dong oru, lukwang mel pe gungeyo lobo ma guo iye, ento guneno gul nam ma kweyo tye iye ci gutamo ni ka twere myero gikel mel i dog tura kunu. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Gungolo tol ma mako lajuk ducu, guweko odong i nam; ikare meno bene gugonyo tol ma onongo gutweyo ki pol<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yat ma ki wiro ki wi yeya.</char></note> ma giwiro ki mel, ka dong gungabo bongo matidi ki tung nyime wek yamo omaki, ci guweko mel omol owoto kun kemo tura. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ento ka guo kama pii mager aryo oromo iye, ci nyim mel otwome ki lobo ma ite pii, ogeto woko liking, te mel bene pii otage oturu woko. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Acikari guyubu ni kinek lumabuc woko ducu, wek acel mo pe okwang oring woko matwal, <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />ento ladit mony ka mito laro Paulo, ojukugi pe oye ki gin me tic ki tamginu. Ociko ni jo ma gingeyo kwang gukwore i pii wi atii gucak kwang wek gukat iwi tura, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />ka lacen jo ma gudong gulub korgi iwi bao mogo nyo iwi dul mel. Kitmeno gin ducu gukonye keken gi gukato iwi tura.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo i cula nam ma kilwongo Malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ka dong watyeko lare, ci waniang ni cula meno kilwongo ni Malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wegi lobo meno gunyutu botwa mar me kica ma pe nen atata. Gin gujolowa, dok gumoko mac pi wan ducu, pien onongo kot ocako cwer ki koyo bene onongo ngic. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo ogwaro rido yen, obolo i mac, ci twol lacocodo omwome woko pi lyeto ka orine i cinge. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Ka wegi lobo meno guneno twol mulyere ki i bade, gucako lok keken gi ni, “Iye ada, laco man laneko. Kadi ka olare ki i nam, langolkop atir pe oye ni obed kwo.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ento Paulo oyengo bade obolo kwede twol i mac ma pe otime gin mo marac. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Gukuru kwe kun gitamo ni bade bikwot woko nyo bipoto piny ci to woko cut; ento ka dong gukuru pi kare malac ci guneno ni gin mo marac pe otime ikome, guloko tamgi, ci gucako waco ni en obedo lubanga mo.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ladit maloyo cula meno, laco ma nyinge Publio, onongo tye ki ngome cok ki kunu, ci ojolowa, ogwokowa pi nino adek. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Won Publio onongo two kun obedo kawinyo lyeto ki cado bene. Paulo olime, olego pire kun keto cinge ikome, ci ocange. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ikare ma man otime, lutwo mukene ducu ma i culanu gubino bote ci gucang. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Gumiyowa mot mapol; ka doki ikare ma wacako wot guketo jami mamite pi konyowa i mel.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo oo i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />I nge dwe adek wamede ki wotwa i mel mo ma oa ki Alekijanderia matye ki cal Rudi inyime, ma odike i cula meno pi kare me koyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Wakwang wao Cirakuca, wadike kunu pi nino adek. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Waa ki kunu, warabo piny nio Regio. Ma nino okato acel, yamo ma a tung acuc okodo, orwone wao Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Wanongo utmego kunu, ci gulwongowa, wabedo botgi nino abiro, ci wao i Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ka utmego ma i Roma guwinyo pirwa, gubino wa i Cuk pa Appio, ki i kabedo ma kilwongo ni Ot Welo Adek pi jolowa. Ka Paulo onenogi, opwoyo Lubanga ci cwinye odoko tek. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ka dong wao Roma, kiye ni Paulo obed i ode kene ki acikari ma gwoke.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo otito lok pa Lubanga i Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ka nino okato adek, Paulo olwongo ludito pa Lujudaya ma gibedo kunu. Ka gucoke bote, en owaco botgi ni, “Utmego, kadi bed pe atimo gin mo marac ikom rokwa nyo ikom kit pa kwariwa, ento kimaka i Jerucalem kitweya, ci kimiya i cing Luroma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ka Luroma gutyeko ngiyo loka, gumito ni kigonya woko, pien onongo pe tye tyen lok mo maromo neka. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Tic 25:11</ref></char></note> Ento ka Lujudaya gucere iye, meno omiyo akoko apil bot Cecar, pien yo mukene dong onongo peke, kadi bed pe atye ki adot mo ma apido ki roka. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo amito ni anenwu ci alok kwedwu, pien kitweya ki nyor man pi gin ma gen pa Jo Icrael ocung iye.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Gugamo ni, “Pe walimo waraga mo ma oa ki Jerucalem ma loko ikomi, pe tye ngat mo ikin omegiwa ma oa kunu ma okelo lok mo ikomi, nyo ma oloko lok mo marac ikomi. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ento wamito waniang tami ki boti, pien wangeyo ni i kabedo ducu kiloko lok marac ikom dul man ma in icwako ni.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Gin gumoko nino ci gubino bote i ot ma en bedo iye. Jo mapol ma welgi kato wel jo ma obino nino ca. Ci Paulo oyeko lok ducu kore ki kore cake odiko nio wa otyeno kun tito lok kom ker pa Lubanga atyer ci otemo ywayo tamgi wek guye Yecu ki lok ma okwanyo ki i Cik pa Moses ki i buk pa lunebi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Jo mukene guye lok ma en otitoni ento jo mukene gukwero ye. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ci gucako ket woko ma kin gi opoke woko kitmeno ka dong Paulo oloko lok acel ni, “Cwiny Maleng yam oloko kakare bot kwariwu ki i dog lanebi Icaya ni,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Ica 6:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref></char>
    </note> ‘Cit iwac ki rok man ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Winyone mere wubiwinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">ento pe wubiniang teloke;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">nenone wubineno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">ento pe wubingeyo gin matye.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Pien jo me rok man cwinygi ongil woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">itgi bene oding woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">dok gumiyo wanggi woko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">wek pe ginen ki wanggi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">pe bene giwinyo ki itgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">pe bene gilwodo lok i cwinygi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">pe giloke gidwog bota acang gi.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Myero dong wunge ni, lare man ma Lubanga omiyo dong kicwalo woko bot Lurok; gin gibiwinyo.” [<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Ka owaco lok meno, Lujudaya guket woko kun gitye ka pyem matek ikin gi keken gi.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paulo obedo kunu pi mwaka aryo kun kwo ki lime kene ci jolo lwak jo ducu ma bino bote. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Obedo katito lok me ker pa Lubanga, pwonyo bene lok kom Rwot Yecu Kricito atyer ma pe kijuke.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>